<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">1 Leengte</book>
  <para style="h">1 Leengte</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Leengte</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Leengte</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Leengte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David leengpa atehta a, akum zong atamta hi; tuachi’n puon tampi a sil sah ua, hinanleh lum asa tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaziehin a suohten akungah, “Ka pu uh leengpa a dingin nungah siengthou khat kisui henlen; amanu’n leengpa kem henlen, tualeh ka pu uh leengpa’n lum asah theina dingin; amanu na angsungah lum zel heh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel gamsung pumpi ah, nungah melhoi a sui ua, Shunam mi Abishag amu ua, tualeh leengpa kungah ahing zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua nungah khu a mel ahoi mama a, leengpa akem a, neh leh taah abawl pieh a, hinanleh leengpa’n apawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Haggith tapa Adonijah in, “Kei leengpa a pang ding ka hi” chiin akiliensah mama hi, tualeh sakolleengte, sakol tungtuong mite leh mi sawm nga, amasanga tai ding a guong zou diem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh apa’n zong lah, “Bang dinga, tambanga gamta na hiei” chi’n aphawh kha ngai sih hi. Tualeh ama zong mi mel hoi mama ahia, anu’n Absalom zou a anei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zeruiah tapa Joab leh siempu Abiathar toh akithukup ua, amaun Adonijah panpi in azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Siempu Zadok, Jehoiada tapa Benaiah guolnei Nathan, Shimei leh Rei, te tualeh David mi hat leh hangsante pen Adonijah langah apang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Adonijah in belamte, bawngtalte, ganva thaute, En-rogel kunga um; Zoheleth suongpi tungah athat a, tualeh a sanggam leengpa tapate zousie leh leengpa suohte, Juda mi zousie achiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh guolnei Nathan leh Benaiah te leh mi hat hangsante tualeh asanggampa Solomon achiel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nathan in Solomon nu Bathsheba ahoupi a, akungah, “I pu David theilou kal in Haggith tapa Adonijah leeng in apangta chi za lou na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin hing pei inlen, nangma hinna leh na tapa Solomon hinna na humbit theina dingin lem ka hing guotpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lengpa David kungah va lut inlen akungah, Aw leengpa ka puin na suohnu kungah, “Na tapa Solomon keima nua ah leeng in apang ngeingei dinga ka leengtoupha ah atou ding chiin na kichiem asiei mah? bang chidan a Adonijah leenga hing pang atai mah?” vachiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa toh na houlim lai mama un kei zong na nua ah ka hing lut dinga, na thugen ka hing suhdet pieh ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Bathsheba leengpa indan sungah ava lut a, leengpa ateh mama ta a, Shunam mi Abishag in leengpa neh leh taah abawl pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bathsheba in kun in leengpa chibai abuh a, Tualeh leengpa’n “Bang ahiei na dei?” ana chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amanu’n akungah, “Pu aw, Mangpa Pasian min in na suohnu kungah, Na tapa Solomon keima nua ah leeng in apang ngeingei dinga, ka leengtoupha ah atou ding, chiin na kichiem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh En in, tuin Adonijah, leeng in apanga, tuami ka pu leengpa’n na theikha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh aman bawngtalte, gan vathaute leh belamte tampi athat a, tualeh leengpa tapate zousie, siempu Abiathar leh galkap lamkai lien Joab te achiel a, hinanleh na suohpa Solomon achiel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh ka pu leengpa aw, nangma nua a, ka pu leengpa, leengtoupha a tou ding na phuondoh ngah in Israel mipite zousie mit nangma tungah atu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahisihleh hichi ahi dinga, ka pu leengpa apulepate kunga, a imut hun chiengin, kei leh ka tapa Solomon pen sil bawlkhiel a ngohin ka um ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh ngaiin tuabanga leengpa ahoupi laitah in guolnei Nathan zong ava lut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“En in guolnei Nathan ahing lut hi” chiin leengpa ahil ua. Tuachia leengpa masanga ava lut tah in, leengpa masangah amai tuol suin chibai abuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Nathan in “Aw leengpa ka pu in, ka nua chiengin Adonijah leeng ahi dinga, ka leengtoupha tungah atou ding na chikha amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen tuni in akuon suh a, bawngtalte, gan va thaute leh belamte kiningching tahin athat a, leengpa tapate, galkap lamkai liente leh siempu Abiatharte achiel a, tualeh ngaiin amasangah ne in adawn ua, Pasian in leengpa Adonijah humbit hen, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh na suoh kei bang, siempu Zadok bang Jehoiada tapa Benaiah bang, tualeh na suohpa Solomon bang ahing chiel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kapu leengpa thu a tam sil kibawl ahiei mah? Tualeh ka pu leengpa, leeng toupha a ama nua chienga tou ding koi pen ahiei chi, na suohte na hil nailou hivateh izaw?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa David in adawnga, “Bathsheba hing hatpieh un” achia, tuachi’n amanu khu leengpa umna ah ava lut a, amasang ah ava ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa akichiema, “Ka mangbat gentheina zousie a, hing hundohpa Mangpa min in ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na kunga Mangpa Israelte Pasian min loua, Na tapa Solomon, ka nua chiengin leeng in apang ngeingei ding a, ka suohpa ka leeng toupha tung ah ahing tou ding hi chia, ka kichiem bangbang in tuni’n ka bawl ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Bathsheba khu amai a tuolsuin akhupboh a, leengpa chibai abuh a, “Ka pu leengpa David kumtawn in damta hen, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa David in, “Siempu Zadok leh guolnei Nathan tualeh Jehoiada tapa Benaiah hing hatpieh un” achi hi. Tuachi’n amaute amasangah ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lengpan akung uah, “Na pu uh suohte pui unlen, tualeh ka tapa Solomon khu keima Sabiltung mama tungah tuongsah unlen, tualeh Gihon mun ah va pui suh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khummun ah Israel leengpa dingin siempu Zadok leh guolnei Nathan in sathau nu sah un, tualeh pengkul mut unlen, Pasian in leengpa Solomon humbit hen, chiin kikou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama hing zuitou unlen, tualeh ama ahing pei dinga, ka leeng touna tungah atou ding a, keima thahengin vai ahawm ding hi. Israelte leh Judate tunga vaihawm dinga keiman ka guot ahita,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoiada tapa Benaiah in leengpa adawnga, “Amen, Mangpa ka pu leengpa Pasian in lem sahpi tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mangpa kapu leengpa kunga a um bangin Solomon kungah zong umta hen, aleeng toupha zong ka pu leengpa David leengtoupha sangin thupi sah zawta hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachibangin, siempu Zadokte, guolnei Nathante Jehoiada tapa Benaiahte, tualeh Kereth mite, Pelethmite, apei suh ua, Solomon khu David sabiltung tungah atou sah ua, Gihon mun ah apui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Siempu Zadok in Bieh buh akipat in sathau koina saki ala a, Solomon sathau anuta hi. Tuachi’n pengkul amut ua, mi zousie in “Leengpa Solomon damsawt hen,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh mi zousie in azui ua, theile atum ua, akipah mama ua, ahusa un leithuong akihot sah kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n Adonijah leh akunga um ami chielte zousie in a ann neh zou un, tua husa khu azata ua, tualeh Joab in pengkul gin azah tahin, “Khopi sunga husa pialpual pi bangchidan ata diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Khuchia agen laitahin, Abiathar tapa Jonathan ahing tunga, tualeh Adonijah in, “Hing lut in, nang pasal pha na hia, thuhoi thupha hing tut navateh maw,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jonathan in Adonijah adawnga, “Tut sing e, ipu leengpa David in Solomon leengpa in apang sah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Lengpa’n ama toh siempu Zadokte guolnei Nathante, Jehoiada tapa Benaiahte, tualeh Kereth mite leh Peleth mite asawl a; tualeh amauten Solomon khu leengpa sabiltung tungah atousah ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Siempu Zadok leh guolnei Nathan in Gihon ah leengpa dingin sathau anu uhi; tualeh khuna kipat in nuomsa tahin apeitou ua, tuachi’n a husa un khopi sung leithuong akihotsah hi. Tuami husa ahi na zah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh Solomon zong leengpa, leengtouna tungah atou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuathamlouin leengpa nasem miliente zong ipu leengpa David thupha pedingin ahing pei ua, Pasian in nangma min sangin Solomon minthangsah zaw henlen, tualeh aleengtoupha zong nangma leengtoupha sangin thupi sah zawta hen achi ua; tuachi’n leengpa alupna tungah Pasian bie in akuun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n zong tambangin agen hi, ka mit mu ngei a, tunia ka leengtouna a tou ding hing guot piehpa Mangpa Israelte Pasian min phat in umta hen, achi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n Adonijah kunga um ami chielte zousie azauta mama ua, tualeh adingdoh ua a inn lam chiet uah akipeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuachi’n Adonijah in Solomon agiingta a, adingdoh a, ava pei a, maitam kii ava tuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Tuachi’n, Adonijah in leengpa Solomon agiinga, leengpa Solomon in a suohpa namsau a thatlou dingin kichiem phot heh, chiin maitam kii atu hi,” chiin Solomon ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Solomon in adawnga, “Mi gin um leh dihtah ahina asuhlat thei leh asam zang khat zong tuol ah ake sih dinga, hinanleh gitlouna anei le vang ashi ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Solomon in mi asawl a, maitam akipat in azawpi suh ua, tualeh ama ahing pei a, kun in Solomon chibai ava buh a, tualeh Solomon in “Na inn langah peita in,” ana chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n David shi ding hun ahing nai tahin, atapa Solomon kungah thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Leitung pumpi ngaina dan banga pei ding ka hita a, tuaziehin hattahin um inlen, kipasalsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na sil bawl pouma leh na kiheina lam tenga na lamzan theina dingin, Mosi dan a kigiel bangin Mangpa na Pasian in alampite zuiding leh athupiehte, atawndan thuguotte, avaihawmna dante leh athutheisahte pom dinga athupiehte zui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa’n keima tungtang thua, Na suohten alungtang zousie u’leh, ahinna zousie ua, ka mitmu a thutah a gamta dinga, aumdan ua apilvang u’leh Israel leengtoupha a tou ding mi akibansam sih ding hi chia agen khu, asutangtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tuathamlouin Zeruiah tapa Joab in ahing bawldante, Israel galkap lamkai ni Ner tapa Abner leh Jether tapa Amasa abawldan na thei hi Amaute athat a, galmuon lai a, kidou sisan asuo a, atai a agah akawnggahte leh akenga abu akengdapte sisan aluonkhum sah dante na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin na pilna dungzui in bawl inlen, tualeh alu a samkang pou in, lungmuong tahin han ah lut sah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Gilead mi Barzillai tapate tungah hepina langsah inlen, na dawkan a ann nete lah ah pangsah in, na sanggampa Absalom zieh a ka taimang lai in ka kungah ahing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh ngaiin Bahurim khuo a Benjamin mi Gera tapa Shimei na kungah a um hi, aman Mahanaim lam zuon a ka pei niin awsie chizat huoi tahtah ahing lawkhum a, hinanleh Jordan ah adawn in ahing pei suh a, tuachi’n namsau a that lou dingin Mangpa min in kana kichiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin ama khelna neilou bangin ha sin, mi pil nahi ziehin atunga na bawl ding dan na thei hi, hinanleh alu a asamkang sisan toh han na zuon sah ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n David khu apu apate kungah a imuta a, David khopi ah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israelte tunga David leenga apan sung kum sawm li ahi a; Hebron ah kum sagi leeng in apanga, tualeh Jerusalem ah kum sawm thum leh thum leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon khu apa leengtoupha tungah atou a, tualeh agam khu nasa taha sudetin ahing umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Haggith tapa Adonijah khu Solomon nu Bathsheba kungah ava haw a, amanu’n “Hoilam thu a hing haw hina vateh maw?” ana chia, tualeh aman “Hoilam thu ah hi e,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman na kungah “Siem ding bang ahiei khat ka nei hi,” achi kia a, Amanu’n “Siem ve,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tuachi’n aman leenggam khu kei a ahita chi na thei a, tualeh Israel mi zousie’n leengpa hi dingin kei lam ahing en chiet uh chi na thei hi, hinanleh leenggam khu na lehei a, tuachi’n ka sanggampa a ahita hi, Mangpa a kipan ahi zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin sil khat nget ding ka hing nei hi, hing it vawt sin aw,” achi a. Tualeh amanu’n “Siem vawita,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Hepitahin leengpa Solomon hing houpi pieh inlen (nang thu asel ngai sih ding hi) Shunam mi Abishag khu ka zi dingin hing phal pieh heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Bathsheba in, “Ahoi hi, leengpa kung ah ka hing gen pieh ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin Bathsheba khu Adonijah adinga leengpa Solomon houpi dingin akungah ava hawta hi. Tualeh leengpa amanu kimupi dingin adingdoh a, amanu masangah akuun a, tuachi’n atouna ah atou a, tualeh leengpa nu touna ding leengtouna khat akoi sah a, azietlam ah atouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n akungah, “Sil neu noukhat hing ngen vang, hing niel vawt sin,” achi a, tualeh leengpa’n akungah, “Ngen ve nu, ka hing niel vawt sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n “Shunam mi Abishag na sanggampa Adonijah ziin nei sah in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Solomon in adawnga, anu kung ah, “Bangchidan a, Shunam mi Abishag, Adonijah dinga na nget valong ahiei? leenggam zong nget pieh vanglah ve, ama ka upa hilou i? ama ading leh siempu Abiathar ading leh Zeruiah tapa Joab a dingin zong ngen vanglah ve leh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Solomon “Mangpa min in akichiemta a, Adonijah in tam thu ama shina ding a, agen ahi lou pouma leh Pasian in alaw law hing law henlen tua sanga thupi zaw in zong, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, ahing sudet a, ka pa David leengtoupha a hing tou sah a, athu chiem banga innkuon hing na phukhietpiehpa Mangpa min in ka gen ahi, tunia Adonijah tha ngeingei ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Lengpa Solomon in Jehoiada tapa Benaiah asawl a, aman ava that ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh siempu Abiathar kungah “Leengpa’n Anathoth khuo ah nangma inn leh lou ah peimang in shi tah na hi, hinanleh ka pa David masanga Pasian bawm na zawn zing zieh leh ka pa hasatna thuohna zousie a hasatna nana thuoh ziehin tutung in vang ka hing that sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin Solomon in Abiathar khu Mangpa siempu ahina atawpsah a; Mangpa’n Shiloh khuo a, siempu Eli innkuonte tungtang thu a ana gen atangtun theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum thu Joab kungah ahing tunga; Joab in Absalom ana zuilou vangin, Adonijah lam ah apang hi. Tuachi’n Joab khu Mangpa biehbuh sungah atailut a, tualeh maitam kiite ava tudenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh Lengpa Solomon kungah, “Joab Mangpa biehbuh sungah atailut a, maitam kungah aum denta hi,” chiin ava hil ua. Tuachi’n Solomon in Jehoiada tapa Benaiah asawl a, “Kuon inlen va satlia in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Benaiah khu Mangpa biehbuh ah ava lut a, Joab kungah “Leengpa’n hing pawtkhie heh” achi hi, ava chi a hinanleh aman, “Hing pawt sihvang, tanah ka shi den mai ding hi,” achi hi. Tualeh Benaiah in Joab in “Hichibangin ahing na dawng hi,” chi’n leengpa kungah thu atut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Benaiah thu apie a, “Agen bangin va that inlen, vui ngal in; azieh umlou pi a, Joab in sisan asuona akipat kei leh ka pa innkuonte na hing suhsieng theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama sanga hoizaw leh kizenzaw mi ni Ner tapa Abner Israelte galkap lamkai lien leh Jether tapa Amasa Judate galkap lien tegel ka pa David theilou a, namsau a ana tha ziehin Mangpa’n asisan phuba ama tungah athuh zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaute sisan mawna Joab lutung leh ahahlesuonte lutungah kumtawn in um henlen, hinanleh David tung leh ahahasuonte tungah tualeh aleengtouna tungah pen Mangpa a kipat lungmuonna kumtawn in aumdenta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoiada tapa Benaiah ava kuontou a, ava satlia a, athatta hi, tualeh gamdai a ama inn ah vui in aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n Lengpa’n Joab mun ah Jehoiada tapa Benaiah, galkapte lamkai lienpen in apang sahta hi, tualeh siempu Zadok khu Abiathar mun aluo sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n Shimei ahan sah a, akungah “Jerusalem khopi sungah na inn ding bawl inlen, heimah pawtdoh sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Na pawtdoh a kidron lui na kaan ni niin na shi ngeingei ding ahi chi theiin, na sisan mawna nangma lutung mama ah a um ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Shimei in leengpa kungah, Adih hi ka pu leengpa’n na gen “Bangbangin na suoh in ka bawl ding hi,” achi hi. Tualeh Shimei khu Jerusalem ah hun sawt tah aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hinanleh kumthum zou in Shimei suohte ni Gath leengpa Maakah tapa Akish kungah ataimang ua, tualeh Shimei kungah “Na suohte Gath ah aum” chin ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Shimei akisa a, asabiltung vante a guonga, Gath khuo a Akish kungah ava haw a, asuoh tegel Gath khuo akipat ava ladohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Shimei Jerusalem a kipat Gath khuo ah ava haw a, ahing tung kiata chiin Solomon ahilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Shimei ahan sah a, akungah Na pawtdoh a, gam danga khuolnahaw ni niin na shi ngeingei ding chiin, “Mangpa min in ka hing kichiem sahin, ka hing thei sah hilou ahiei mah? tualeh nang zong ka kungah, na thu gen ahoi hi, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Bangdinga Mangpa kunga na kichiemna leh ka hing thu pieh nitlou na hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Lengpa main Shimei kungah, “Ka pa David tunga na lunggil a gitlouna toh na gamtatna zousie na thei sieng hi, tuaziehin Mangpa’n nangma gitlouna maw khu nangma lutung mama ah aum sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hinanleh leengpa Solomon vang guolzawl in um van in, tualeh David leengtoupha khu Mangpa masang ah kumtawn in suhkip in aum ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Jehoiada tapa Benaiah thu apie a, ama akuontou a, ava sat pua a, athatta hi. Tuachi’n leenggam khu Solomon khut ah suhkip in aumta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Solomon in Izipt leengpa Pharaoh toh kizopna abawla, tualeh atanu akitenpi hi. Tuachi’n ama inn leh Mangpa inn alam zou masangsie leh Jerusalem khopi kulpi a im zou masangsie David khopi ah aum sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum hunlai in mipiten mun sangte ah kithoina abawl zel uhi, khum hun masang a Mangpa min a ding inn akibawl nai tadi lou ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon in Mangpa a it a, apa David tawndan thupiehte azui zel a, mun sangte ah kithoiin gimnamtuite ahal zel chilou ngal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa, Gibeon khuo ah kithoi dingin akuon a, tua mun khu mun sang poimaw tah ahi a; Solomon in tua maitam tungah halmang sillat tul khat tah alaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gibeon khuo ah Mangpa zanlai in Solomon kungah amangin ava kihil a; tualeh Pasian in ngen in, “Bang ahiei kang pieh ding?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Solomon in akungah, “Nangma’n na suoh ka pa David na masangah dihtatna leh muonhuoina toh lungtang kituptah a aum dungzuiin, atungah hepina thupitah Na lang sah ngitnget a, aleeng touna a tou dingin tapa Na pie a, tunia ahing um tah mabangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Mangpa ka Pasian tuin Nangman na suohpa ka pa David taangin leengpa dingin Na hing pangsahta a, hinanleh kei pen naupang neu nou ka hia, thusuh thutou bangma ka thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Na suohpa khu Na mitelte, mipi tampi sim senglou, atam zieh a thei seng guolloute lah ah ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin asie apha ka thei thei a, Na mite vai ka hawm theina dingin, Na suohpa asie leh apha khen siem theina lungtang hing pie in, Na mi tamzapite koi in avaihawm pieh thei diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomon in tam silte anget zieh in, Mangpa akipah sah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian in akungah: “Nangma damsawtna ding bang, hausatna ding bang, tualeh na melmate shina ding bang, ngenlou a, tam sil na hing nget a, vaihawm siemna leh theisiemna, na hing nget zawh ziehin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngai in, na nget dung zuiin ka bawlta hi; pilna leh theisiemna lungtang ka hing pie a, tuachi’n nangma masangin nang bang koima a um ngainai sih a, nang nua chiengin zong nangma bang koima ahing um nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachieng leh na nget khahlou hausatna leh mite zatatna zong ka hing piehbe nalai hi; tuachi’n na damsungin nang toh kibang leeng dangte lah ah koima aum sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na pa David in azui mabanga ka thugousiete leh ka thupiehte na pom a, ka lampite na zui leh ka hing damsawt sah nalai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon akhanglou a; ngaiin amanglam ana hi a, tualeh Jerusalem ah apei a, Mangpa thuhun bawm masangah adinga, tuachi’n halmang sillat leh lemna sillatte alan a, tualeh asuohte zousie a dingin annkuong alui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n numei kizua ni leengpa kungah ava pei ua, amasangah ava ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Numei khatnu’n akungah, “Aw ka pu, tam numeinu leh kei inn khat a um khawm ka hi ua, tualeh amanu toh inn sunga ka um laiun, keima’n nau ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka nau nei zou nithum niin, tam numeinu’n zong nau ahing nei a, tuachi’n ka um khawm ua, tua inn sungah koumagel chilou midang umpi ka nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zanlai in tam numeinu’n ata anet khum khah ziehin ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu zan kimlai in athou a, ka imut lahkal in ka tapa ka panga pat in aladoh a amanu angsungah asiel a, tualeh ama tapa shisa khu ka angsungah ahing siel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zingmawng a nau nawi pe dinga ka thaw leh ama ashisa ana hita hi, hinanleh zingmawng a, ka et chien leh ngaiin ka tapa keima hin pen ana hita sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh numei khatpen in, “Ahisih hi, nausen hing pen kei a ahia, ashi pen nangma tapa ahi,” achi a, tualeh khatnupen inlah ashipen nang tapa ahia, ahing pen kei tapa ahi zaw, achia, tuabangin leengpa masang ah agen tuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n “Tam minu’n ahing pen kei tapa hia ashi pen nang tapa ahi, achi a; tualeh akhat pen in lah, Hilou ashi pen nang tapa ahia, ahing pen kei tapa ahi, achi zel hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n “Namsau hing la un” achia, tuachi’n leengpa masangah namsau khat ahing tawi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n “Nau ngeh hing nalai pen tun ni suo unlen, akim khat khatnu pie unlen, tualeh akimkhat ma adang khatnu kungah pie un,” chiin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n anau hing zawpen neinu in atapa ait mama ziehin; leengpa kungah, “Pu aw hepitahin nausen hing pen amanu pe zaw mai in,” that vawt sin achia. Hinanleh khatnu pen in, “Kei a lah hisih henlen, nanga zong hi tuom da mai heh,” tumtan zaw in, achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n adawnga, “Nausen hing zawpen amanu pie un, that sih un, ama anu ahi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel mi zousie’n leengpa thu khenna athutan dan azah tah un leengpa a giingta mama uhi, aziehpen dihtah a thukhenna dingin Pasian akipat pilna ama ah aum chi atheidohta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Solomon khu Israelte zousie tungah leeng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tamte amilien neite ahi uhi. Zadok tapa Azariah siempu ahi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Shisha tapate Elihoreph leh Ahijah laigieltute ahi ua; Ahilud tapa Jehoshaphat khu tanchin gielpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoiada tapa Benaiah khu galkap lamkai lienpen ahia, tualeh Zadok leh Abiathar khu siempute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nathan tapa Azariah khu miliente houtu ahia, Nathan tapa Zabud pen khu siempu leh leengpa thu moppa ahi khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahishar khu innsung lam kem lamkai lien ahia, tualeh Abda tapa Adoniram pen, na sem a kiguoite enkoltu lamkai lien ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon in Israelte zousie tungah vaihawm lien sawm leh ni anei a, tuaten leengpa leh a innkuonte adingin neh leh taah angaituo zel uhi; mi khat in kum khat in ha khat zel neh leh taah ding angaituo ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tamte amin uh ahi. Ephraim singtang gam ah Benhur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ben-Deker in, Makaz, Shaalbim, Beth-Shemesh, tualeh Elon Beth-Hanan khuote apuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ben-Hesed in Aruboth gam a puo a; aman Sokoh leh Hepher gam pumpi zong a puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ben-Abinadab in Dor gamkai zousie apuo a; aman Solomon tanu Taphath ziin anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahilud tapa Bana in Taanak leh Megiddo khuote, Jezreel kho nuoi, Zerethan kho kunga um, Beth-Shean biel zousiete ah, Beth-shean akipat Abel-mehola tan, tualeh Jokneam lelam gal tan dongin apuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ben-Geber in Ramoth-gilead khopi leh Gilead gam sunga Manasseh tapa Jair khopite atanga, tualeh Bashan gam aum Argob gamkai leh akhopi lien tahtah sawm guh kulbang leh akalna sum-eng zawl neite zong atang khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Iddo tapa Ahinadab in Mahanaim atang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naphtali gam Ahimaaz in atanga; aman zong Solomon tanu Basemath ziin anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asher leh Aloth gam Hushai tapa Baanah in atang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Issakar gam Paruah tapa Jehoshaphat in atang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Benjamin gam Elah tapa Shimei in atang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gilead gam, Amor leengpa Sihon gam, tualeh Bashan leengpa Og gam, Uri tapa Geber in atanga; tualeh ama pen khum gam a, lamkai lien umsun ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judate leh Israelte khu tuipi pieu a, Pieunel bangmai in atam ua, ane un, adawn ua, nuomsa tahin a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon leenggam pumpi tungah, Euphrates lui akipat in Philistin gam tandongin, tualeh Izipt gamgi tandongin vai ahawm a, tua gamten Solomon dam sungin sie apie ua, ana asem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni khat sunga Solomon neh leh taah maimai tangbuong nel hoite seu sawm thum leh neh ding miluh sawm guh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawngtal vathau sawm, gantatna mun a hampa ne bawngtal sawmni, belam za khat tualeh sakhite, sazuhte, sakhitalte leh aah kiva thaute ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n luigal langkhat gam pumpi tungah Tiphsah apat a, Azzah tandongin lui gal lelam a leengte zousie tungah vai ahawm a, tualeh akimvel a mite zousie toh galmuong in aum chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Solomon dam sung tengin Dan akipat in Beer-Sheba tandongin Judate leh Israelte michin ama uh grep nuoi leh atheipi nuoi chiet uah bit tahin aum chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Solomon in sakolleng kai, sakol tul sawmli leh sakol tungtuong mi tul sawm leh tul ni anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh tam milienten amauh tan ha sung chiet uah Solomon leh leengpa Solomon dawkan a a annkuong impite zousie neh ding angaituo zel ua, bangma akitasam sah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi chinin amauh panmun dinga kiguot dungzuiin, akoina dinga kiguot mun ah sakolte leh ganta taihatte adingin barli bu leh bupawlte ahing polut zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pasian in Solomon pilna leh theisiemna, thupi mama leh lungsim letna tuipi pieu a pieunel bang mai a tam apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Solomon pilna in suolam mite zousie pilna leh Izipt mite pilna zousie akhup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama mi zousie sangin apil zaw a, Mahol tapate Ezra mi Ethante, Hemante, Kalkolte Dardate sangin zong apil zaw hi, tuachi’n akimvela namte zousie lah ah amin athang suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aman thupil tul thum agen a, tualeh late tul khat leh nga aphuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sing tanchinte zong, Lebanon taanga sidar sing kungte akipat in kul banga hing poudoh hissop tangthu dongin agen hi. Aman sate leh tungleeng vate tangthu agen a, tualeh bohvah a peite leh ngate tanchin zong agen zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon pilna zakha pouma, nam chin a mite leh leitunga leengte zousie akipat mite Solomon pilna ngaikhe dingin ahing kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tai-ar leengpa Hiram in Solomon khu apa David thaheng a leengpa a pang dingin ama sathau anu uh chi azah tahin Solomon kungah mi asawl hi, Hiram khu David na ngaina ngitnget khat ana hi mawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in Hiram kungah mi asawl a, akung ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mangpa’n akeng nuoi a amelmate akoi masang sie’n ka pa David in akim avel a, ning chin tenga kidounate ziehin, Mangpa a Pasian min dingin inn alam thei sih chi na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin vang Mangpa ka Pasian in mun chin tengah galmuonna ahing peta a, tuachi’n melma aum nawn sih a, vangsietna zong aum nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai in, Mangpa’n ka pa David kunga na thaheng a na leengtoupha a ka tousah ding na tapa’n ka min adingin inn alam ding chia ana gentah mabangin, tuin Mangpa ka Pasian min a inn lam ka tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin Lebanon taanga Sidar singte ahing sat pieh na dingun thu na pie inlen, ka nasemte leh na nasemte apangkhawm ding ua, na nasemte thaman pha nasah bangbangin ka pena ding hi, aziehpen Sidon mite banga sing sui siem ka lah uah aum sih” chi na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiram in Solomon thu gen azah tahin akipah mama a, “Tam nam thupitah tunga vaihawm ding a, tapa pil tah David pepa Mangpa khu tuni’n phat in umta hen,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hiram in Solomon kungah mi asawl a, “Na hing sil thuhahte ka ngaituota hi, tualeh Sidar sing leh taa singte tungtang thu ah zong na dei bang bangin kana bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka nasemten Lebanon taanga kipat in tuipi dongin ahing tawlsuh ding ua; tualeh akoina dinga na guotna mun tuipi pieu a tawl suh dingin ka gah khawm dinga, pum in ka hing tawl suh dinga tua mun ah ka ngakhesah dinga, tuachi’n nana la ding hi, tualeh nang zong ka innkuonpite neh leh taah nana tuoh dinga, kadei na hing buchin sah ding hiven,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hiram in Sidar sing leh taa singte Solomon in adei zaza apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon in Hiram kungah a innkuonte neh dingin bu seu tul sawmni leh sathau siengthou chin sawmni apie hi. Hichibangin kum chinin Solomon in Hiram ape zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n achiemsa mabangin Solomon pilna apie a, tuachi’n Hiram leh Solomon kikaal ah kilemna aum a, tuachi’n ani un kizopna thuhun abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Solomon in Israel mi zousie lah ah na sem mi ki guoi teitei pawl abawldoh a, tua banga akiguoi teitei na sem pawl mi tul sawm thum apha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lebanon taangah ha khat in mi tul sawm asawldoh a, Lebanon ah ha khat ava um ua, inn lam ah hani a um zel ua, akihengzel uhi. Adoniram khu tam banga kiguoi teitei nasemte lamkai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon in van gih puo mi tul sawm sagi leh suong kheng mi tul sawm giet sing tang gamte ah anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuate simlou in Solomon in nasem mite tunga enkai ding mawngmawng in lamkai mi tul thum leh zathum anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lengpa thupieh bangin inn suongphum ding suong khensa lep dingin suong lien pipi leh suong mantam tahtah ahing puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon innlam mite leh Hiram innlam mite tualeh Gebal mi suong khen siemten, suongte akheng ua, a inn lamna dingun sing leh suongte abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, Israel tate Izipt gam a kipata ahing pawtdoh nua uh, kum zali leh kum sawm gietna, tualeh Israelte tunga Solomon leengpa a apan zou kum lina, hani na Ziv hain Mangpa inn bawl apan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa inn dinga leengpa Solomon in abawl inn khu asaulam tong sawm guh availam let dan tong sawmni ahia, tualeh asan lam tong sawm thum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh khum inn, amun siengthou mailam a inn him khu, a inn vailam tantan tong sawmni a sau ahia, tualeh amailam a pen, vailam tong sawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh inn adingin kottate vathangkal neu nounou nei in abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Inn baang kimkot leh biehinn baang kimkot in, tualeh mun siengthou leh mun siengthou sungta zaw kimkot in pindan abawl a, tualeh akimvel in chiel adaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chiel nuoi nung pen tong nga in alien a, alaita pen tong guhin alien a, tualeh athumna pen tong sagi a lien ahi, tualeh akalvaite khu inn baanga gollut ngaise louin, apulam baangah akingahna akibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biehinn kibawllai in asuongte khu akilahna mun a khen tuohsa diem a kibawl ahia, tuachi’n abawl sungun seh ginte leh hei ginte, tualeh sia vanzah gin mawngmawng tua biehinn kibawl kim ah akiza sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pindan laita pen lutna kot khu a inn zietlam pangah a um a, tualeh adan laita pen kaltouna kellei kivielin akal tou a, tualeh alaita akipat in athumna ah akaltou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Biehinn ahing lam a, azouta hi. Tua inn khu Sidar sing zawl leh singpehte in akhu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh innpi toh kizopin pindante abawla, tua pindan khat khu tongnga in asang chiet a, tuate khu Sidar sing zawlte a Biehinnpi toh zop ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu Solomon kungah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tam inn na lam laitah tungtang thu ah, ka tawndan thu guotte na nit a, ka vaihawmna dante na zui a, ka thupiehte zousie zui dinga na zop leh, na pa David kunga ka gensa, ka thu na tungah ka subuching ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate lah ah ka teng dinga, tualeh ka mi Israelte ka nuasie sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in tua Biehinn alama, azouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biehinn sunglam baang dingin Sidar singpeh azang a, atuong leh abichiing nuoi dal dingin zong Sidar singma akhen hi, tualeh atuong dingin taa sing peh apha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Biehinn sia lang tong sawmni a lienpen zong atuong leh abaangte Sidar sing peh in abawla, mun siengthou leh mun siengthou pen a dingin zong a sunglam ah azang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Biehinn, munsiengthou khu tong sawmli a sau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Biehinn sung lam a pape mum leh pape pahpal bang lim a kikhengte a un in Sidar sing ngen a kibawl ahia, suong mawngmawng akimu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasian thuhun bawm koina dingin zong tua Biehinn sungta pen langah mun siengthou pen kichi khat zong abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua Biehinn sung tawng pen khu tong sawmni in asau a, availam zong tong sawmni ma ahia, tong sawmni in asanga, inndan sung pumpi sana siengthou ngen in aluon khum hi, tualeh Sidar sing akibawl maitam zong sana a luonkhum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in Biehinn sung khu sana siengthou in aluonkhum a, tualeh mun siengthou tawngpen mailang ah sana khainieng in dantanna abawl a, tua khu sana tuiin aluonkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Biehinn azaw sieng masangsie’n mun siengthou sunglam zousie sana tui aluon khum a, tualeh mun siengthou pen maitam zong sana tui aluon khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mun siengthou pen sungah Olive singin tong sawm tuoh a sang, Cherubim ni abawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cherub khat ha langkhat tong nga a, sau ahia, tualeh aha langkhat pen zong tong nga ma a sau ahi. Tua Cherub ha mong lang khat akipat lang khat lam ha mong tan, tong sawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cherubim khat pen zong tong sawm ma ahia, tua Cherubim tegel alet aneu akibang ahia, tualeh apien dan gel zong thakhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cherub tegel sandan tong sawm tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Cherubim tegel khu pindan sungta zaw ah akoi a, Cherubim tegel in aha uh azah tuoh ua, Cherubim khat ha in baang lang khat asukha a, tualeh Cherubim dang khat pen ha in zong alelam baang asukha hi. Tualeh pindan laikim tah ah aha u’leh aha uh akisutuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua Cherubimte zong sana tui aluonkhum a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Biehinn baang zousie leh munsiengthou baang zousie asunglam leh a pulam zong, cherubim limte leh tum singte tualeh pape pahlai limte gielin azem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Biehinn sung leh apulam tuongtung leh mun siengthou tuongtung zong sana tui in aluonkhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mun siengthou lutna ding kotkhate Olive singin abawl a, akotpi tung leh akotpi biengte, abaang senga suo sekhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kotpi nite gel zong Olive singa kibawl ahia, tualeh atungah Cherub lim bang, pape pahpal lim bang giel in sanatui aluon khum a, tualeh Cherub leh tum sing limte sana tuiin aluon khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n mun siengthou kotkhah dingin zong Olive sing khuom ningli neiin abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua kotpi nite khu taa singa kibawl ahia, kotkha khat a singpeh ni akihip thei a kibawl ahia, tualeh akot dangkhat peh ni zong akihip thei ma ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh atungah Cherubte, tumsingte tualeh pape pahpal limte agiela, tualeh tuabanga kilawm tah a, kizemte khu sana tui in aluon khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Biehinn huongsung leituol sungta zawpen khu suong kikhengsa guolthum leh sidar sing peh thuo khat in abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Akum li na Ziv hain Mangpa inn suongphum lep pat ahia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh akum sawm leh khatna aha gietna Bul hain, bawl ding bangbangin bangma zousie mansa sienga ahita hi. Tuachi’n kum sagi alam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh Solomon in ama inn ding kum sawm leh kum thum sung alam a, tuachi’n ama inn ding alam zou siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon in Lebanon gammang ah sing inn khat zong ana lam hi, adung tong za khat ahia, avai tong sawm nga ahi, tualeh tong sawm thum a sang ahi. Sidar sing khuom guol li a kiphut atunga sidar sing innkam kikhang tunga bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua khu khuom sawm li leh nga tunga kikhang innkam tunga Sidar singpeh kipha khum ahia, aguol khatna ah singpeh sawm leh nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abaang lang khat tuoh ah kimaingat chietin kotta guol thum a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kotpite leh kotpi khuom zousie ning li nei a kibawl chiet ahia, tualeh kottate guol thum in akimaingat tuo chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman khuom lienpi ngen kiphut kikhopna inn khat zong abawl a, asau lam tong sawm nga ahia, availam tong sawm thum ahi. A innhim khu khuom te mailam ah aum a, amaidoh khuna nei zong aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n avaihawm na ding leh athu khenna ding Mangtoupha umna dingin inn lienpi abawl a, tua khu atuong alang khat apat alelam tan Sidar singpeh kipha ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh ama tenna inn in, a innhim sungah huong khat anei a, tua zong khuchimabanga bawl ahi. Solomon in azi Pharaoh tanu adingin zong tuabang innhim khat abawl pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamte zousie suong mantam pipi, akituoh hun giap chiet akikheng, aki at thaw suong, tualeh akisuithaw suong ngen a kilam ahia, apulam zong asuong phum akipat among tandongin, tuabang in a pulam huong lienpi tandong akibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh asuong phum khu, suong mantam tahtah leh suong lienpipi, tong sawm bang tong giet bang a lep khawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atung lam ah suong mantam tahtah, akituoh chitchet a kikheng suong leh Sidar singte ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh akimkot in ahuong sung inntuol khu suong guol thum leh Sidar singpeh thuokhat a ki im ahi. Mangpa innhuong sungta zaw leh a innhim mabangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lengpa Solomon in mi asawl a, Tai-ar khuo akipat in Hiram ava puisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amapa khu Naphtali phung sunga meithainu tapa khat ana hi a, apa khu Tai-ar gam sunga sum-eng khen siem ahi. Hiram khu sum-eng bawllam ah theisiemna, pilna tualeh khut siemna nei vawt mi khat ahi. Ama leengpa Solomon kungah ahing pei a, akunga sep dinga kipie nna zousie asem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman tong sawm leh tong giet a sang sum-eng khuom ni aphut a, akhuom pum letdan zong tong sawm le ni tuoh tuoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuom dawn a taa ding sum-eng sunbaw ni abawla, abaw khat sanlam tong nga ahia, akhat pen san dan zong tong nga ma ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuom dawna abawte gel zepna dingin sum-eng pape guilien kiham bangin agiel a, bawkhat ah sagi a um a, tualeh khat pen ah zong sagi ma a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n khuomte abawla, tua khuom lubawte tuomna dingin kawlbuthei lim kigiel khat tungah akimvel in guol ni a um a, tua mabangin khat tung ah zong a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh innhim khuom dawn a abawte ah tong li tuoh in lilipah lim aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua khuom nite dawn a abawte ah, apawl biil biel gei ah kawlbuthei banga kikhengte a um hi, tualeh tua abawte ah kawlbuthei zani tuoh tuoh a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua khuomte khu Biehinn innhim ah aphut a, a zietlam khuom aphut a, amin dingin Jakin ahisah a, tualeh aveilam khuom zong aphut kia a, amin dingin Boaz achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua khuomte dawn vum ah lili pape liente atuonga tuachi’n khumte bawl zou ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman tuikuong lienpi khat sum-eng kisungin abawl a, agei lang khat apat, langkhat tan tong sawm ahi. Tuikuong khu abem ahia asan dan tong nga ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Agei nuoi ah pa mum lim in akimkot a, tong sawm ahia, tuikuong kimkot in a um a, tualeh pa mum limte khu, akisun lai in guolni a kisung pai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua tuikuongpi khu sum-eng a kibawl bawngtal sawm leh ni tungah a kikoi a; bawngtal lim thum in mallam anga a, thum in tumlam anga a, thumin simlam anga a, thumma in suolam anga hi; Tualeh atuikuong khu ama uh tungah akinga a, innsung lam anua ngat chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuikuong gei khu khutpeh chia a sa ahia; agei zong nou gei bang ahi, agei ah lili pah lim atuonga. Tui tena bath tul ni dawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiram in khuomte tunna ding sum-eng khuom tunna sawm a siem a, tuami khuom tunnate tong li chiet a sau ahia, alet dan zong tong li chiet ma ahi, tualeh asan dan tong thum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khuom tunna zousie kisiemdan pen tambang ahi, akuoh ning li nei a bawl ahia, tua akuohte khu agei kikaal ah aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh agei kikaal a kuohte ah, humpibahnei limte, bawngtal limte tualeh cherub limte bang aum hi; Tualeh agei tungah khuom tunna a um a, tualeh anuoi lam ah humpibahnei limte, bawngtal limte, nuoiah akilawmna dinga kibawlte a um diudeu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khuom tunna khat chietin sum-eng kari keng li chiet leh sum-eng zawl li chietma anei hi. Aning li zousie ah atunna ding akiphut chiet a, tualeh kisilna bel nuoi lam ah atunna a um a, tua atunna sih chiet ah azepna a um chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh bel gong kuol sunglam gei khu tong khat a lien ahia, agong gei khu akuola bem ahia, tong khat leh alanga lien ahi, akuohte khu abem sih a, ning li nei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh akuohte nuoi langah bawnglengte a um a, tualeh a bawnglengte tunga innte khu, khuom tunna toh akizop a, tualeh bawnglengte san dan khu tongkhat leh alang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh tua bawngleng kengte kibawl dan khu sakolleng keng toh kibang ahi, atung sinte abelvielte akikaal a sia kiphante leh alaibawte akisunthaw ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh khuom tunna khat ning li chiet ah, akingahna li chiet ma aum a, tua akingahna khuom tunna toh pumkhat chiet ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh akhuom tunna tungah abem a kiviel in tong kimkhat a sang a um hi, khuom tunna tunga akeng kuohte zong pumkhat ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh atunna kuongdaite leh akuohte ah azah bang bangun Cherubte humpibahneite, tum singte a tuong sah a, akimkot in azem dim diem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuabangin atunna sawmte abawla, a bawn in pum khat a sun ahi chiet a, bawldan kibang chiet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n sum-eng kisilna kuong sawm abawl a, kisilna kuong khat in tui bath sawm li adawla, tualeh kisilna kuongte khu tong li chiet ahi ua, tualeh khuom tunnate tung chiet ah kisilna kuong khat akitung chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh a inn zietlam pangah khuom tunna nga atunga, tualeh zietlam pangah khuom tunna nga ma atunga, tualeh tuibel khu inn zietlam pangah suolam ah simlam nga in atung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hiram in kisilna kuongte, vut luohnate maiphiet kuongte abawl a, tuachi’n Hiram in Mangpa inn dinga, Solomon abawl pieh zousie azou siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Khuom ni tegel dawn a bel banga abaw nite tuomna dinga len kiphan banga pawl bimbemte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua len banga kiphan pawl bimbem tuomna dinga kawlbuthei za lite, khuom dawna bel banga baw nite tuomna dinga pawl bimbem tuoh kawlbuthei guol nite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualeh khuom tunna sawmte leh khuom tunna tunga, tuikuong sawmte bang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh tuikuong khat leh tuikuong nuoia bawngtal sawm leh nite bang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Belte vut luohte leh maiphiet kuongte, tualeh Mangpa inn a dinga, leengpa Solomon in Hiram anawt valsah sitset sum-eng um leh bel zousie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Jordan phaijanga Sukoth leh Jaretan kikaal a, bellei ki khenna mun ah ahi, leengpa’n asun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Solomon in um leh belte atam sengseng zieh in buh ngaise louin a um sah a, sum-eng te zong bang za a gih ahiei chi, theidoh butlou in aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Solomon in Mangpa inn a um leh bel zousie abawl a, tualeh sana maitam tanghou siengthou koina ding zong abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tualeh mun siengthou sungta pen mai ah thaumei koinate zietlam ah nga, veilam ah nga, sana siengset in abawl a, papete, thaumeite, taitete zong sana in abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Noute, thaumei puontenate, maiphiet kuongte, tawkeute, gimtui halna bawmte, khu sana siengset a bawl ahia; Munsiengthou pen kotte leh biehinn kotte leh akhainate sana sieng set a kibawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in Mangpa inn ding abawl zousie azouta a, tualeh apa David in ana latsa silte Solomon in ala lut a, dangkate leh um leh belte Mangpa inn a gou koinate ah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in Israel upate zousie, nam lah a lamkai zousie tualeh Israelte lah a phung lamkai zousie David khopi Zion akipat Mangpa thuhun bawm potou dingin Jerusalem a leengpa Solomon kungah ahankhawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mi zousie leengpa Solomon kungah Ethanim ha, aha sagina ann kuong luina ah ahing kikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel upate zousie ahing tun tah un, siemputen, thuhun bawm azawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amauten Mangpa thuhun bawm leh kimutuona puon buh, tualeh, biehbuh sunga tuiumbelsuon siengthou zousie apotou ua, siempute leh Leviten azawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Solomon leh akung a Israel hing kikhawmte zousie Pasian bawm masangah a um khawm ua, belamte, bawngtalte atam seng zieh a sim senglou leh aphaza thei zaw lou in akithoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n siemputen Mangpa thuhun bawm khu a umna ding mun Biehinn mun siengthou sungta zaw, mun siengthou pen a, Cherubimte ha nuoi ah akoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cherubimten thuhun bawm umna tung aha un azah khum ua, tualeh Cherubimten thuhun bawm leh atunga azawnna chieng zawlte aha un a lie khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azawnna chieng zawlte asau a, azawnna chieng zawl mongte, mun siengthou sungtazaw mai a, mun siengthou akipat in akimuthei a, hinanleh inn pulam akipat akimu sih hi; tualeh tuni tanin khunah aum denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipat a ahing pawtdoh lai ua, Israel tate kunga, Mangpa’n thuhun abawl lai a, Mosi in Horeb muol a, suongpeh ni akoite loungal, tua bawm sungah bangma dang a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, Siempute mun siengthou a kipat a ahing pawtdoh tah un, Mangpa inn meilum in ahing tuom dim khiang khuongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n meilum ziehin siemputen anasep uh asunzom theita sih uhi. Mangpa thupina in, Mangpa inn aluodim tah zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in thu agen a: “Mangpa’n meilum miel lah ah, ka um ding ana chita mawnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima’n na tenna dingin, kumtawn a Na tenna ding in, Inn ka hing lam pieh hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa akinuahei a, Israel kikhawmte zousie aguolzawl a, tuachi’n Israel kikhawmpite zousie a ding demdum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman, “Mangpa Israelte Pasian pahtawi in umta hen; Aman ka pa David kungah Ama kam mama in agen, tualeh Ama khut mama in atangtung sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipat a ka mi Israelte ka puidoh ni a kipat in, ka min umna ding inn bawl dingin Israel nam pumpi khuote lah ah khat zong ka na tel kha sih a; hinanleh David pen ka mi Israelte tunga vaihawm dingin kana tel hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka pa David in Mangpa Israelte Pasian min a inn khat lam ding alungsim in ana tum zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa’n ka pa David kungah, ka min a inn khat bawl ding chia na lungsim a na atup khu, tambang lungsim na puoh zieh in ahoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangtenghileh nangman inn nalam sih dinga, na khaal akipata hing pieng na tapa in ka min a ding in inn alam zaw ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa’n ana thu gensa khu a sutangtungta a, Mangpa’n thu ana chiemsa mabangin, ka pa David mun ka luo a, Israel leengtoupha ah ka hing touta hi, tualeh Israelte Mangpa Pasian min dingin inn khat kana lamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khunah, Izipt gam a kipata, Apuidoh lai a, ipu ipa te kunga Ana hun Mangpa thuhun umna bawm koina dingin mun khat ka guotta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon khu, Israel kikhawmte zousie masanga, maitam mai ah adinga, tualeh van lam ngain akhut azah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa Israelte Pasian, na suohte alungtang zousie ua, na masanga nasemte kunga Na thuhun sutangtunga itna langsah zel, Nangma bang Pasian dang vantung leh leitungah koima aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangman na suoh ka pa David kunga, na chiemsate Na sukipa, Na kam in thu na gen a, Na khut mama in Na sutangtungta hi, tuni a aum tahma bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin Israelte Mangpa Pasian aw, Na suoh ka pa David kunga, Israelte leengtoupha tunga ka mitmu a, touding mi akiphasam sih ding, tualeh ka masanga na gamtat mabanga, na hahlesuonte a umdan ua apilvang pou u’leh, chia Nana thuchiem khu sukip in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aw Israelte Pasian, Na suoh ka pa David kunga na thu gen khu tuin hing sutangtung in, chiin ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Hinanleh Pasian khu lei tungah ateng tahtah na diei mah izaw? Ngai in van leh vante vanah zong tazoulou na hia, tuachi’n tam ka inn lam ah tatzou tuoh sih na va-ia chie maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh Aw Mangpa ka Pasian tunia Na suohin kikou a athumna leh thungette hing sang inlen, Na suohpa thumna leh ngetna hing ngaikhieh pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na mit in sun leh zan in tami biehinn lam en ngitnget henlen, ka min khunah a um ding Na china mun lam nga a, Na suoh thungetna Na ngai pieh theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na suohpa leh Na mi Israelten tam mun lam nga a, thu anget chiengun, angetnate uh Na umna vantung akipat Na ngaikhieh pieh inlen; Na zah chiengin ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Mi koi ahiei in a innvengte tungah sil bawlkhiel in, kichiem sah hiel ahing kiphatmaw tahleh tam bieh inn a, Na maitam masangah hing kichiem henlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nangman vantung akipat Na ngaikhie inlen, mi khielpa khu akhelna bangin ama lutung ah tusah inlen, mawpai in, tualeh midihtat khu adihtatna dungzuiin siemtangsah inlen, Na suohte vaihawm pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Na mi Israelten Na tunga sil abawlkhiel zieh ua, agalte uh masanga aguollel chieng ua, Nangma lam a ahing kihei ua, Na mina akhelna uh akiphuonkhieh ua, Na kunga thu ahing nget chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nang vantunga kipat in Na ngaikhiet pieh inlen, Na mi Israelte khelna ngaidam inlen, apu a pate uh kunga gam Na piehna mun ah puilut kia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Akhelna zieh ua, van akikha a, guo azuhlou chienga, tami mun lam nga a, athum ua, Na min aphat ua, Na suhgentheinate zieha akhelnate uh alengatsan ua akisia u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nang van akipat Na ngaikhie inlen, Na suohte leh Na mi Israelte khelna ngaidam inlen, apeina ding uh lampi hoi kawhmu inlen, agoutan ding ua Na piehna gam ah guo zusahin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Gam sunga kiel ahing tun a, natna hii ahing len a, gawna leh muotna ahing uma, khaukhup ahiei, lung ahiei ahing um a, amelmate un akhopite uh ahing im kimkot ua, bangchibang hii ahiei, natna ahiei ahing um hun chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na mi Israelte lah a koi ahiei in, alungtanga thuoh gimna nei a akithei a, tam Na biehinn lam nga a, banzah a, thumna leh thungetna anei chiengin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na umna van akipat in Na ngaikhie inlen, ngaidam inlen, pan piin, Nang michin lungtang theipa’n aumdan uh dungzui in thuhin; Nangma bou in mihing lungtang na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka pu leh pate uh kunga na pieh na gam a aten sung sie ua, amaute’n nang giin dan ahing theisiemna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Tuathamlouin na mi Israelte hilou gamdang mi, na min zieh a, gamla pia kipata hing peite tungtang thu zong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />(Na min thupitah leh na khut hattahte tualeh na ban na zah thute miten ana zah ua) tuaten tami Biehinn lam nga a, ahing thum chieng un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na umna van akipat in Na ngaikhie inlen, tualeh gamdang miten ahing nget zousie uh Na bawlpieh in, Na mi Israelte mabanga leitunga namchin in Na min athei ua, ahing giinna ding un, tualeh tam ka inn lam Nangma min puo ahi chi a theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Na mite amelmate uh dou dinga, Na sawlna lam lam a akuon chieng un, Na tel khopi lam nga a, tualeh Namin dinga ka biehinn lam, lang nga a, Mangpa kunga athum chieng un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Athumna u’leh ngetna uh, nangman van akipat na ngaikhie inlen, amauh guolzawna pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Na tunga sil abawlkhiel u’leh (koima khiellou aum ngal sih a) atung ua na lungthah a, agalte uh kunga na piehkhieh chiengin, agamla leh anai hitaleh, melma gam a sal a apuimang chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh sal a puimanga a umna gam ua, ahing kingaituo doh ua, kana khielta ua, dihloutah leh giloutah in ka bawlkhata uhi chia, Na kunga thu ahing nget chieng un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Amelma ama uh sal a puite gam a, alungtang zousie u’leh ahinna hagau zousie ua, Nangma lam ahing ngat kia ua, apu apate uh na pieh gam lam leh Na khopi tel leh Na min dinga ka biehinn bawl lam nga a, Na kunga thu ahing nget chiengun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Athumna u’leh angetna uh Nang, Na umna van akipat Na ngaikhie inlen, angette uh na bawl pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tualeh Na miten Na tunga atatkhelna u’leh Na tunga ana gitloutatna zousiete uh ngaidam inlen, ama uh ana hepi theina dingun ama uh sal a puite masang ah lainatna neisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aziehpen amauh Na mite Na goutan, Izipt gam akipat leh haltuina mei sunga kipata Na puidohte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ahing hat pouma chieng ua Nana ngaikhiehna dingin Na suoh thungetna leh na mi Israelte thungetna lam Na mit in hing en in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Aw Mangpa Pasian Izipt gam a kipata ka pu leh pate uh nana pui lai a, Na suoh Mosi zanga nana gen mabangin na goutan dingin leitung nam zousie lah a kipat a na khentuom sa ahita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahia, Solomon in Mangpa kunga thumna leh thungetna zousie agen zou tah in Mangpa maitam mai a van lam a banzah a akhup dinna mun akipat in adingdoh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tuachi’n adingden a, Aw ngai tahin, Israel mipi kikhawmte zousie aguolzawl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“Athuchiem zousie dungzui a ami Israelte khawlna pepa Mangpa pahtawi in um hen; asuoh Mosi zanga, a thuchiem hoi zousie thumal khat zong apelhem a um sih hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Mangpa i Pasian i pu leh pate kunga ana um mabangin ilah uah zong umta hen, hing nuasie sih henlen, hing taisan sam sih heh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Alampi zousie zui ding leh ipu leh pate ana piehsa mabanga, athupiehte, athugousiete, avaihawm dante, nit thei dingin ilungtang Ama lam ngasahta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Asuohpa tungtang thu ah, tualeh Ami Israelte tung thu ah, nisim a apoimaw dung zui a, agamtat theina dingin tam ka thu gen, Mangpa masanga thungetna ka tutte, asun azanin Mangpa i Pasian masang ah um ngitngetta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Mangpa khu Pasian ahi a, adang koima aum sih hi, chi leitunga namchin in athei theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tuachi’n athuguot banga um ding leh athupiehte zui dingin Mangpa i Pasian lam ah na lungtangte uh hoi bukim hen, tunia mabangin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa leh akunga um Israelte zousie in Mangpa masangah kithoina alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tualeh Solomon in, Mangpa kunga alat kilemna sillat, kithoina dingin bawngtal tul sawm leh tul ni leh belam tul za khat leh tul sawmni; alan hi. Tuabangin leengpa leh Israelte zousie in Mangpa inn alanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Khum ni mama in leengpa’n Mangpa inn mai a um leituol huong laita a susiengthou a, khunah aman halmang sillatte, ann sillatte, tualeh lemna sillat sathau alan hi, aziehpen Mangpa mai a um tua sum-eng maitam khu, halmang sillatte, ann sillatte, tualeh kilemna sillatte sathau latna dingin aneu seng taluo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tuachi’n khumi tungin Solomon leh Israelte zousie, mipi tampi kikhawmte khu, Hamath lutna akipat a Izipt gamgi lui tandonga miten Mangpa i Pasian masangah ni sagi leh ni sagi dang, ni sawm leh nili sung pawi abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Ani giet ni in mipite akikhen sah a, tualeh amaun leengpa aguolzawl ua, tualeh Mangpa’n asuoh David leh ami Israelte tunga khuchi lawm lawm a alatsah ziehin lungsim kipah mama in a inn lam chiet uah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, Solomon in Mangpa inn leh leengpa inn, alung tup banga alam zou sieng bepin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gibeon khuo a akunga akilah bangin, Mangpa Solomon kungah aniveina in ahing kilah kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa’n akungah, “Ka masanga na thumna leh na thunget Ka kunga na hing tutte Ka za a, kumtawn a Ka min umna dinga na bawl tam inn ka susiengthouta hi; tualeh Ka mit leh Ka lungsim khum mun ah a um ngitnget ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh nang zong Ka hing thupieh pouma dungzui a, bawl dinga, na pa David mabanga lungtang dih leh kitup taha, Ka masanga na um a, Ka thugousiete leh Ka vaihawm dante na zui leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n na pa David kunga Israelte leengtoupha tunga tou ding mi na kiphasam sih ding chia, Kana kichiem mabangin; Israelte tunga na gam leengtoupha Ka sukip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh nangma na hiei, nahah nasuonte ahiei in, na hing zuina ua kipata, na hing kinua heisan ua, Ka thupiehte leh Ka dan thute na zui sih ua, pasien dangte zui dinga na piel ua, ana nasep ua, na bieh u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauh ka piehsa tam gam akipat Israelte Ka sumang dinga, tualeh ka min umna dinga ka suhsiengthou tami biehinn zong Ka mitmu akipat Ka paimang dinga, tuachi’n Israelte khu namchin lah ah paunah leh aselama gentena leh enghouna in apang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh tami biehinn tuin thupi nanleh; a apkai bep dinga, akunga peikha pouma in lamdang asa ding ua, achiza sengin achiukawh ding ua, tualeh bangchidan a tam gam leh biehinnpi Mangpa’n hichitalawma abawl adiei? achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n miten Izipt gam a kipata apulepate uh puidohpa Mangpa a Pasian uh ataisan ua, pasien dangte abelsan ua, abie ua, ana uh asep zieh uh ahi. Tuazieh a Mangpa’n tam sil hoilou zousie atung ua atunsah ahi,” chi’n adawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahia, Solomon in inn nite, Mangpa biehinn leh leengpa inn abawl sung kum sawmni abei nua in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />(Tai-ar leengpa Hiram in Sidar singte taasingte, sanate, adei zousie apieh ahi a), tuachi’n leengpa Solomon in Hiram kungah Galili gam a khuo sawmni apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hiram khu Tai-ar khuo akipat in Solomon in akho piehte en dingin ahing pei a, hinanleh adei lam ahi tasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n akungah, “Ka unaupa na hing kho piehte bangchibang khuote ahiei?” achi hi. Tuaziehin tuate khu Kabul gam akichi denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hiram in leengpa sana talent za leh sawmni ahah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lengpa Solomon in nasem dinga goi teitei pawl abawlna ziehpen tami ahi. Mangpa biehinn leh ama inn lam ding leh Millo leh Jerusalem kulpite leh Hazor khuo, Megiddo khuo leh Gezer khuote bawl dingin ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Izipt leengpa Pharaoh akuontou a, Gezer khuo ava la a, mei in ahaltum a, tualeh khum khopi a teng Kanaan mite athat a, tualeh atanu Solomon zi kungah vanken silpieh in ana pezouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Solomon in Gezer khuo abawla, Beth Horon nuoita zaw khuote,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Balath khuo leh Juda gamdai a Tadmor khuote,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tualeh Solomon neitah koina, khuote zousie a sakolleng koina khuote, sakol tungtuong mite, Jerusalem, Lebanon leh agam pumpi sunga Solomon in bawl atupte zousie abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate hilou, Amormite, Hitmite Perezmite, Hivmite leh Jebusmite aum nalai namte zousie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahah asuonte uh khum gam a um nalai, Israelten asuhmang zou sieng theiloute uh lah a, Solomon in suoh nasem dinga goi teitei pawl abawla tuni tan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel tate pen Solomon in suoh nasem teitei pawl in abawl sih a, aziehpen amaute, galkap mite innsung vaisaite, miliente, galkap lamkaite, asakolleng leh sakol tungtuong pawl lamkaite in apang zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuate khu Solomon nasepna tunga lamkai lien pente ahi ua, tualeh zanga leh sawm ngate khu nasemte vengmite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanleh Pharaoh tanu khu David khopi akipat in Solomon in amanu inn dinga alam pieh langah apeitou a, tuachi’n Millo abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon in Mangpa adinga abawl maitam tungah halmang sillatte, kilemna kithoina sillalte kum khat in thum vei alan zel a, tualeh Mangpa masanga maitam tungah, gimnamtui ahal zel hi. Tuachi’n Biehinn lam azouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Solomon in Edom gam a tuipi san pieu ah, Eloth kunga um Ezion Geber mun ah tembaw hon abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hiram in tua tembawte a Solomon mite toh na sem khawm dingin, tuipi umdan thei siem mite leh tembawh hawlsiem mite asawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh amaute Ophir ah ava pei ua, khuna kipat in sana talent zali leh sawmni ava puo ua, Solomon leengpa kungah ahing tut uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian min zal a Solomon minthan dan Sheba leengnu’n ana zah tahin thu hamsa pipi donga amapa ze et tumin ahing pei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amanu nuazui thupitah toh, gimnamtuite, sana tampi, tualeh suongmantamte puo sangawngsaute hing zawpi in Jerusalem ah ahing pei a; tualeh, amanu Solomon kunga ahing tun in alung sim thu dei guotteng agen a adongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in athudoh zousie adawnga; leengpa a dingin hilchien ding hamsa bangma aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Sheba leengnu’n Solomon pilna zousie amu leh a inn bawl te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Adawkan a ann neh dingte, anasemte toudan, neh leh dawn petute nasepdan, akhohei dan uh, nou petute umdan leh Mangpa biehinn a kilan halmang sillatte amutahin, lungsim bangma zong aneithei ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa kungah, “Na silbawlte leh na pildante ka gam a thu kigen kana zahte khu adih mama ana hi ngut ngei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh keiman ka mit mama a, ka mu masangsie in agen uh kana tahsang sih a; tuachi’n ngaiin akimkhat zong ahing na hil zou sih uhi, agen uh kana zah sangin, na pildan leh na lawchindan athupi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na masanga ding ngitnget a, na pilna ngaikhezing na mite leh na suohte ahampha uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian na tunga kipah mama, Israelte leengtoupha a hing tousahpa pahtawi in umta hen; Mangpa’n Israelte khantawn in a ita, tuaziehin dihtat tah a vaihawm dingin leengpa in ahing pang sah hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n leengpa sana talent za leh sawmni, gimnamtui atama tam leh suongmantamte apie hi. Sheba leengnu’n Solomon leengpa apieh gimnamtui za koiman ape nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Ophir akipat a sana hing puo, Hiram tembawhte in zong, ophir akipat in Almug sing atama tam leh suongmantam tampi ahing polut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n almug singte khu Mangpa biehinn leh leengpa inn bawlna ding leh lasamite kaiging leh pehging bawlna ding bangin azang hi. Tuni tan in tuabangin almug sing ahing kipolut nawn mawngmawng sih a, mu zong akimu kha nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Lengpa Solomon in adeisah zieh a apiehte ban ah zong, leengpa Solomon in Sheba leengnu’n adei teng leh anget pouma apie hi. Tuachi’n agam lam ah asuohte toh anua peikiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Solomon kunga kumkhat sunga sana lut gihdan talent za guh leh sawm guh leh guh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Summet bawl mite apat a kila, gimnamtui a kivaimite, Arab gam leengpa apat a kila, tualeh agam sung vaipote apata kimute, simkhahlou ahi nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Solomon in sana lum lien zani apeh in akhenga, lum khat ah sana shekel za guh alut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh sana khen pheng main awmphaw zathum abawl a; awmphaw khat ah sana minas thum alut a, tuate leengpa’n Lebanon gammanga a inn ah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Lengpa’n saiha in leengtoupha thupitah khat abawl a, tuakhu sana hoipen tuiin aluon khuma.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lengtoupha in ketot guh anei a, tua leengtoupha nualam tungah abem in ahing kikuol suh a, touna sih tuoh ah ban ngapna a um a, aban ngapna douna tegel khu humpibahnei lim ni in adou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh tua ketot guhte gei langkhat tuoh ah humpibahnei sawmleni lim adinga, tuabanga kibawl koima gam ah zong aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Solomon zu dawnna nou zousie sana akibawl ngen ahia, tualeh Lebanon gammanga a inn a bel leh kuong zousie zong sana siengthou a, kibawl ngen ahia, dangka akibawl aum sih hi, tuakhu Solomon damlai in bangmatham in akingaisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lengpan tuipi ah Hiram tembawh hon kithuopi ding summet bawlna tembawh hon anei hi. Tua summet bawlna tembawh hon ten kum thum hal in, sanate, dangkatate, saihate, zawngliente leh utongte puo in ahing kile zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Solomon in leitunga leengte zousie hausat lam leh pilna lam ah akhup sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pasian in alungtanga pilna akoipieh ngaikhe dingin leitunga mi zousie in Solomon ahing zuon zung zung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kumchina akunga hinghaw michin in kipahman pieh ding dangka akibawl bel leh kuongte, Sana akibawl bel leh kuongte, puonsilte, galvante, gimnamtuite sakolte, sabiltungte ahing pezel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon in sakollengte leh sakol tungtuong mite akhawm khawm a, sakolleng tul khat leh zali leh sakol tungtuong mi tul sawm leh tul ni anei a, tuate sakolleng koinate ah, Jerusalem khopi a leengpa umna ah aum sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lengpan Jerusalem khopi sunga dangkasia atam seng seng ziehin suong bang vawt a tam in sievum in a um sah a, tualeh sidar singte lah phaijanga theipi sing bang giap a ngai in aum sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Solomon in Izipt gam leh Keveh gam akipata hing kitawl lut sakolte anei a; tualeh leengpa summet bawl miten Keveh kichi mun ah ava lei zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipat in sakolleng khat dangka shekel za guh in akilei a, sakol khat dangka shekel za leh sawmnga in akileizou hi. Tuabangin leengpa summet bawlte akipat in Hitmite leengte zousie leh Siria leengte kungah a zua sawn sah zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Solomon in namdang numei tampi adeigaw a, Pharaoh tanu bang, Moab numei bang Ammonte, Edomte, Sidonte, Hit numeite adeigaw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua namte tungtang thu, Mangpa’n Israel tate kungah, “Amaute kipawlpi sih unlen amaun zong noute hing kipawlpi sih uheh, aziehpen a pasiente uh zui dingin na lungsim uh a puimang ngei ngei ding uhi,” chia ana gensa mawng ahia, hinanleh Solomon in amaute akitenpi teitei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n leeng innsung mi zi zasagi anei a, tualeh mei zathum anei hi; tuaziehin aziten alungsim ahei kawi piehta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen hichi ahing ahi a, Solomon ahing upat nua in, aziten pasien dangte zui dingin alungsim ahei kawi piehta ua, tualeh apa David mabangin alungtang khu Mangpa a Pasian lam ah ahoibukim zou tasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuazieh in Solomon in Sidon mite pasiennu Ashtoreth leh Ammon mite pasien kidahhuoitah Milkom azuita mawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in Mangpa mitmu in silgilou ahing bawlta a, apa David mabangin Mangpa azui chinten tasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon in Jerusalem suolam a muolkhat ah Moabte pasien kidah huoitah Kemosh ading leh Ammon mite pasien kidah huoitah Molek a ding in munsang ana bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachimabangin a namdang zite zousie adingin abawla, amauten khunah apasiente chiet ua dingin gimnamtui leh kithoinate ahal zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n akunga nivei kilah Israelte Mangpa Pasian alungtanga akiheisan ziehin, Mangpa khu Solomon tungah alungthahta mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami tungtang thu ah Ama’n pasien dangte na zui ding ahi sih chiin zong thu ana pieh sa ahita a, hinanleh aman Mangpa thupieh azui sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n Solomon kungah, “Tambangin sil na bawlta a, Ka thuhun leh, Ka thuguotte, pom dinga Ka hing thupiehte na zuitahlou ziehin na leenggam Ka hing phalsuo pieh ngei ngei dinga, na suohpa kungah Ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangtenghileh, na pa David zal in nangma damsung in Ka bawl naisih dinga, hinanleh na tapa khuta kipat in Ka phalsuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh gam pumpi Ka hing lahpieh sih dinga, Ka suoh napa David zal in nam khat na tapa kungah Ka pe ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Edom mi Hadad, Solomon melma dingin ahing dingdoh sahta a, ama khu Edom gam leengpa hahlesuon ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen hichi ahia, David Edom gam a aum laiin, galkap lamkai Joab, Edom gam a pasal taphot atha zou nua in ami thate vui dingin ava kuon tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(Aziehpen Edom gam a pasal pouma atha zou masangsie’n Joab khu Israel mi zousie toh khunah ha guh sung ava um uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hadad khu apa suohte lah a Edom lawikhat toh Izipt gam a pei ding in atai ua. Hadad khu naupang neu nou ahi nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Midian gam a kipat in apawtdoh ua, Paran ava tung ua, tualeh paran akipat in mite azawpi ua, tuachi’n Izipt gam leengpa Pharaoh kung atung suh ua, aman inn ana pie a, neh dingte ana ngaituo pieh a, tualeh gam zong ana pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Hadad in Pharaoh mitmu in deisahna thupitah atanga, azi sanggamnu toh akiteng sah a, tuakhu leengnu Tahpenes sang gam nu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Tahpenes sanggamnu’n tapa Genubath ahin pieh a, amapa khu Tahpenes in Pharaoh innsungah a nawineh tawptan akep pieh a, tuachi’n Genubath khu Pharaoh inn sungah Pharaoh tate toh a um khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hadad in Izipt gam akipat in David apu le pate kungah a imuta chi leh galkap lamkai Joab zong ashita chi azahtah in; Hadad in Pharaoh kungah “Ka gam a ka pei theina dingin, hing peisanta vang” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pharaoh in akungah, “Ka kunga na um in bang tahsap na nei a ahiei thakhat a na gam lam a pei na sawm mawh?” achi hi. Tuachi’n ama’n “Bangma ka tasam sih, hinanleh hing peisah mawngmawng in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in Solomon a dingin melma dang khat, Eliadah tapa Rezon, apu Hadadezer Zobah leengpa, kunga kipat a taimangsa ahing dingdoh sah kia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />David in Zobah khuo a mite atha lai in Rezon in mite akungah akhawm khawm a, Tua ahel pawlte lamkai in apanga, tualeh Damaska khuo ah apei ua, khunah ava teng ua, tualeh vaihawm in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rezon in Hadad silgilou bawlte belapin Solomon damsung teng Israelte melma ahi ngitnget a, Israelte amuda mama a, tualeh Siria gam pumpi tungah vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon suohpa Zereda khuo a Ephrath mi Nebat tapa Jeroboam, anu min Zeruah meithai khat ahi, ama zong leengpa douin ahelta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa tunga ahelna zieh pen hichi bang ahi; Solomon in Millo abawla, tualeh apa David khopi sietna munte abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jeroboam khu mihat leh hangsan ahia; tualeh Solomon in tua tangvalpa khu mi thanuomtah ahi chi theiin, Joseph innkuonte nasep zousie tunga houtu dingin abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua hun lai in hichi ahing hia, Jereboam Jerusalem akipata apawtkhiet lai in, Shiloh khuo a mi guolnei Ahijah in lampi ah ana tuoh a; tualeh aman puon tha khat asil a, tuachi’n amaute gel guoh gamlah ah aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Ahijah in apuon tha sillai ala a, abotkeh a phal sawm leh phal ni asuo a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh aman Jeroboam kungah “Phal sawmte kilah in, aziehkhu Israelte Mangpa Pasian in tam bangin achi hi; Ngai in Solomon khut a pat in leenggam ka botkeh dinga, nam sawmte nangma ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />(Hinanleh aman ka suohpa David zal leh Israel nam zousie lah a ka tel khopi Jerusalem ziehin nam khat atang ding hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama un Kei ahing taisan ua, Sidonte pasiennu Ashtoreth bang, Moab mite pasien Kemosh bang, Ammon mite pasien Milkom bang abieh zieh un leh, Ka mitmu a silhoi bawl ding leh Ka thugousiete leh, Ka vaihawmna dante pom dinga apa David banga Ka lampite azuilou zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh aleenggam pumpi pen akhut akipat in Ka lahpieh sieng sih dinga, hinanleh Ka thupiehte leh Ka thugousiete pompa Ka tel Ka suoh David ziehin adamsung leeng in ka pangsah nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanleh atapa khut akipat aleenggam Ka lahpieh dinga, tuachi’n nangma kungah nam sawmte Ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Ka suohpa David in Ka min umna dinga Ka tel khopi Jerusalem a, Ka masanga thau mei avah sah ngitnget theina dingin, nam khat atapa Ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n nang Ka hing guot dinga, na lungtangin adei bangbangin vai na hawm dinga, Israelte tungah leeng in na pang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, Ka hing thupieh zousie na pom a, Ka lampite na zui a, tualeh Ka suoh David mabanga, Ka thugousiete leh Ka thupiehte zui dinga, Ka mitmu a silhoi na bawl leh Ka hing umpi dinga, David adinga innkuon dettah Ka bawl pieh mabangin innkuon dettah mai Ka hing bawlpieh ding a, Israel Ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tamte ziehin David hahlesuonte ka sugenthei ding hi, hinanleh kumtawn in vang ahisih ding, achi hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaziehin Solomon in Jeroboam tha atumta a, hinanleh Jeroboam adingdoh a, Izipt gam leengpa Shishak kungah ataimangta hi, tuachi’n Solomon shi masang sie’n Izipt gam ah a umdenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuin Solomon nasep dangte a silbawl zousie leh apilnate Solomon nasepte gelna laibu ah akigiel hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Solomon in Israelte zousie tunga Jerusalem khuo a, avaihawm sung khu kum sawm li ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n Solomon apu a pate kungah a imuta a, apa David khopi ah avuita uhi, tualeh atapa Rehoboam in ama thahengin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboam Shekem khuo ah apei a, Israelte zousie zong ama leengpa a bawl dingin Shekem khuo ah ahing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahia, Nebat tapa Jeroboam in tam thu ana zahin (Jeroboam pen leengpa Solomon akipata taimang Izipt gam a va tengden ahi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeroboam ava hansah ua. Tualeh Jeroboam leh Israel kikhawmte zousie ahing pei ua, Rehoboam kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na pan ka hahkol uh agih sah thei mama a, tuaziehin tuin na pa’n ahing suhgimnate leh hahkol gihtah ka tung ua akoi khu hing suh jang pieh inlen, tuachi’n na nna ka sem ding uhi,” chi’n ava gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Ni thum sung vanua pei kia phot unlen, tuazou chiengin hing peikia un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n mipite apei kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Rehoboam in apa Solomon damlai a, ana vaihawmpi zel zel upate kungah, “Tam mite ka dawn dingdan ngaidan kituptah bang na nei uoi?” chi’n adong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaun akungah, “Tunia tam mite nasema na um a, amauh na dawn a, akung ua thu hoitah na gen leh kumtawn in na suoh in apang ding uh” chiin agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh ama’n upate lem guotpina amang sih a, ama khanguol avaihawmpite adongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Akung uah, “Na pa’n ka tung ua hahkol gihtah ahing koi hing suh jang piehin chia hing genmite idawn theina dingun bang na hing lemguot pi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n akhanguol tangvalten akungah, “Na pa’n ka hahkol uh agihsah a, hinanleh nangman hing suh jang pieh in chite kungah tambangin na chi ding hi, ka khutme ka pa kawng sangin alienzaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka pa’n hahkol gihtah ahing guon leh agihzaw sem ken ka hing guon dinga, ka pa’n chienga ahing zep leh ken sia chiengin ka hing zep ding hi chiin,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeroboam leh mipi zousie leengpa’n nithum nua chiengin ka kungah hing pei kia un chia ana hil bangin, anithum niin Rehoboam kungah “Ahing pei kia” uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n mipite khautahin ana dawnga, upate lemguotpina apom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tangvalte lemguotpi bangin, ka pa’n na hahkol uh ana gihsah a, ken na hahkol uh ka belap nalai ding hi; “Ka pa’n chiengin ahing zepa ken sia chieng in kahing zep ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n mipite thugen apomta sih hi; tam silte Mangpa a hing kipan ahiziehin, Nebat tapa Jeroboam kunga Shiloh mi Ahijah zanga athugen atangtun theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel mi zousiein leengpa’n athu uh apom sih chi atheitahun, “David ah goutan bang inei uoi? Jesse tapa ah gou luo ding bang ma inei tuom sih uh,” Israelte aw na puon inn lam chiet uah pei ta un, Aw David na innkuon kingaituo maiin, chi in leengpa adawng ta uhi. Tuachi’n Israelte apuon inn chiet uah a ki pei ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh Juda gam a khopite a teng Israel tate zousie tungah Rehoboam in vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Rehoboam in nasem dinga agoi teitei pawlte lamkai Adoram asawl a, hinanleh Israelte zousie’n suongin ana sep ua ashita hi. Tuaziehin leengpa Rehoboam Jerusalem khopi a tai tumin asakolleng tungah kintah in atuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelte David innkuonte tungah tuni tan in ahelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahia, Israelte zousie’n Jeroboam ahing nua pei kiata chi azah tahun, akikhop khawmna uah ahansah ua, tuachi’n Israelte tunga leeng ding in abawlta uhi. Juda nam chilou ngal David innkuonte zui koima aum sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Rehoboam in Jerusalem khopi atun tahin Israel innkuonte dou a, Solomon tapa Rehoboam ading a, nualah kia dingin Juda nam zousie leh Benjamin nam mihangsan teldoh ngentang tul zakhat leh tul sawm giet galkap akaikhawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian mi Shemaiah kungah, Pasian thu ahing tunga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Juda gam leengpa Solomon tapa Rehoboam kung leh Benjamin innkuonte kungah, tualeh mipi um nalaite kungah va gen inlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tambangin Mangpa’n agen hi, Na sanggamte uh Israelte dou dingin na kuontou ding uh ahisih hi, michin a inn lam chiet uah nua peikia uheh, Tami keima bawl ahi chiin genin,” achi hi. Tuaziehin amaun Mangpa thu amang ua, tualeh Mangpa thu dungzuiin anua peikia chietta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeroboam in Ephraim muol ah Shekem khuo abawla, khunah ateng a, tualeh khuna kipat in apeidoh a. Penuel abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Jeroboam in alungsim in “Tuin tami leenggam pen David innkuonte a ahing hi kia mai thei hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam mite Jerusalem khopi a Mangpa inn ah kithoi dingin kuontou zelta u’leh, tuachi’n tam mite lungsim apu uh Juda leengpa Rehoboam lam ah ahing kihei kia dinga, tuachi’n kei ahing that ding ua, Juda leengpa Rehoboam abel kia mai ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n mi adonga, sana in bawngnou lim ni abawla, akung uah “Nou a dingin Jerusalem khopi a vahawtou zel ahamsa taluo hi, Aw Israel en un Izipt gam a kipata hing puidoh na pasiente uh” achia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tuachi’n khat Bethel ah akoi a, adang khatpen Dan khuo ah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tam sil khu khelna ahing hita hi, mipite tam bawngnou limte be dingin Dan tandonga apei taah zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh aman munsangte ah innte alam a, Levi mite hilou mipite lah apat in siempu ding mi abawla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jeroboam in Juda gam a annkuongluina pawi abawl mabangun, aha gietna, ni sawm leh ninga ni khu annkuong luina pawi bawlna ni dingin aguot a, maitam tungah sil alan hi. Tuachimabangin Bethel a abawngnou lim bawl kungah kithoina alan hi, tualeh amun sang bawlna siempute Bethel ah akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachibangmain aman alungtanga adei mabangin, aha gietna ni sawm leh ninga niin Bethel a amaitam bawl ah sil alan a, Israelte adingin annkuong luina pawi ni ding aguot a, aman zong maitam tungah sil alan a, tualeh gimnamtui zong ahal hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh ngai in, Mangpa thu in Juda gam a kipat in Pasian mi khat Bethel ah ahing pei a, tualeh Jeroboam khu maitam gei ah gimnamtui hal dingin ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n amapan Mangpa thuin maitam akikou khum a, “Aw maitam, maitam, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, David innkuonte lah ah naupang khat amin Josiah kichi ahing pieng dinga, na tunga gimnamtui hal zel munsang siempute na tunga kithoina dingin ahing lan dinga, na tungah mihing gute ahing hal ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian mipa in tuani main chiemtena apie a, “Tami Mangpa’n agensa chiemtena ahi ding, Ngaiin maitam ahing khipoh dinga, tualeh atunga vutte ahing kibo ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi a, leengpa Jeroboam in Bethel maitam kikou khum Pasian mipa thugen azahtah in, “Man un” chiin akhut in azam phei a. Tualeh mat tum a akhut azan khu azaw denta a, anua kai kia theita sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasian mipa’n Mangpa thu ana gen chiemtena bangin maitam akhipawh a, tualeh avutte zong maitam akipat in akibuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n adawnga Pasian mipa kungah, “Ka khut ahing dam theina dingin Mangpa na Pasian kungah ngen inlen hing thum pieh in achi hi. Tualeh Pasian mipan Mangpa kungah angen a, tuachi’n leengpa khut khu amasanga bangin ahing dam kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n Pasian mipa kungah, ka kungah ka inn lam ah hing pei inlen hing khawl tawldam in, kipahman ka hing pe ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian mipa’n leengpa kungah, “Na inn kimkhat hing pe ding hinanlachin zong na inn ah ka hing pei sih ding hi; tualeh tanah tanghou mawngmawng ka ne sih dinga, tui zong ka dawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen tanghou va ne sinlen tui mawngmawng zong va dawn sin, tualeh na peina lampi a zong na kinuale kia ding ahi sih chia Mangpa thu a sawl ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n lampi tuom ah apei a, Bethel a ahing peina lampi ah zong apei kia nawnta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bethel khuo ah guolnei tehsepu khat aum a, atapaten khum nia Bethel a Pasian mipa sil bawl zousie ahil a, leengpa kunga athu gente zong apa uh ahil sawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh apa un akung uah, “Heilang lampi ah apei ei?” achi hi. Aziehpen ataten Juda gam a hing kipan Pasian mipa peina lampi athei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh aman atapate kungah, “Sabiltung hing bawl pieh un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n sabiltung abawl pieh ua, tuachi’n atuongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian mipa anuadel a, gangpi sing nuoia tou ava muta hi, tuachi’n akungah “Nang hiteh izaw Juda gam a kipat a hing pei Pasian mipa?” achi hi. Tualeh aman “Hima ing e,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akungah, “Ka inn langah hing pei inlen, tanghou hing ne dive,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian mipain na kungah, “Ka hing nua pei kia thei sih dinga, na inn ah zong kang pei thei sih ding a na kungah tanghou nein tui zong ka dawn thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Na nein na dawn sih dinga, na hing peina lampi ah zong na ki nuale lou ding ahi, chia Mangpa thu a sawl ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh aman akungah, “Kei zong nangma banga guolnei khat ka hi; vansawlsieng khat in Mangpa thuin ka kungah, tanghou aneh a tui adawn theina dingin na inn lam ah va puikia in chi’n ahing houpi hi achia,” hinanleh akungah zuou agen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n akungah anua pei kia a, a inn ah ane in adawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, dawkan a ann ne a atou laiin, ama va nua puikia guolneipa kungah Mangpa thu ahing tunga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh aman Juda gam a kipat a hing pei Pasian mipa akikou khumta a, “Tambangin Mangpa’n agen hi, Mangpa thu na man lou zieh leh Mangpa na Pasian in thu ahing pieh, athupiehte zuilou a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na hing nua pei kia a, Mangpa’n tanghou ne sinlen tui zong dawn sin achina mun mama a, “Tanghou na neh a, tui na dawn ziehin” na luong na pu napate han ah akivui sih ding hi,” chiin agenkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, tanghou aneh a tui adawn zou in, Pasian mi ava nua pui kia pa tuonna ding sabiltung abawl pieh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n apeita a, lam kaal ah humpibahnei khat toh akituoh ua, ana petliata hi, tualeh aluong lampi ah alum den a, sabiltung akungah ading den hi, tualeh humpibahnei zong aluong kung ah ading den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh ngaivawi mite ava pei ua, lampi a mishi luong lum leh aluong kunga humpibahnei ding nalai ava mu ua, guolnei tehsepu umna khuo ah ava genta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama vanua puikia guolnei pan tua thu azah tahin, “Mangpa thu manglou Pasian mipa ahi khu, tuaziehin Mangpa’n akunga athu gen bangbang a, humpibahnei kungah apie a ana pelia ahita ve,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n atate kungah, “Sabiltung hing bawlpieh un achia,” tuachi’n abawl piehta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n ava pei a, aluong lampi a lum leh humpibahnei aluong kunga ding ava mu a, humpibahnei in mishi luong ana ne sih a, sabiltung zong bangma alawsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua guolneipan Pasian mipa luong khu ala a, a sabiltung tungah akhanga, anua puoh kia a, tua guolnei tehsepu khu ama suun ding leh vui dingin kho sung ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n aluong khu ama han ah asiel a, “Kadei ka unaupa aw” chi’n akaa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh avui zou tahun atapate kungah, “Ka shi chiengin Pasian mipa kivuina mun ah hing vui unlen agute gei ah ka gute hing koi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian thua Bethel a maitam leh Samaria gam khopite a, munsang inn zousie akikou khumna thu hing tangtung ngeingei ding ahi,” chi’n agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tam sil umte nuain zong Jeroboam in a umdan hoiloute akiheisan tuom sih a, mivantang lah a mi mun sang siempu dingin apang sah a, adei dei akoi tuom a, tuachi’n munsangte a siempuin apangsah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh tam sil khu Jeroboam innkuon khelna leh amauh ingamsah a, tualeh leitunga kipat a sumangthaitu ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuahun lai in Jeroboam tapa Abijah achi ana hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Jeroboam in azi kungah, “Kisa inlen Jeroboam zi na hilam ahing kithei louna dingin kisiem lamdang inlen, Shiloh khuo ah va haw in, ngaiin khunah guolnei Ahijah, tam mite tunga leengpa a ka pan ding tungtang thugenpa a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh tanghou beu sawm leh tanghou pheng tamlou leh khuoizu thawl khat keng inlen akungah va hawin, naupang tung a sil hing um ding ahing na hil mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Jeroboam zi in tuabangin abawla, adingdoh a, Shiloh khuo ah ahaw a, Ahijah inn ava tung hi. Hinanleh Ahijah in khuo amu thei nawn sih a, a upat seng tah ziehin amit amielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Ahijah kungah, “Ngai in Jeroboam zi atapa tungtang thu dongin ahing pei hi, aziehpen achi ana hi; tambangin akungah thu na gen ding ahi, ahing lut chiengin numei dang khat bangin ahing kisiem lamdang ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahijah in kotpi a ahing lut a aketot ging azah tahin, “Hing lut in nang Jeroboam zi, bang achia hing kisiem lamdang na hiei? tanchin hoiloutah hil dinga sawl ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pei inlen Jeroboam kungah, “Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi, Mipite lah akipat ka hing tawisang a, ka mi Israelte tungah vaihawm in ka hing pangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh David innkuonte a kipat in gam ka lahpieh a, nangma kahing pie hi; hinanleh nang ka suoh David bangin na um sih a, ama’n ka thupiehte azui a, tualeh ka mitmu a sildih ngentang bawl dingin alungtang zousie in ahing zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang penin na masanga mite zousie sangin zong sil hoilou na bawl sese a, nang lungthahsah theina dingin na levah a, milim kisunthaw pasien dangte na bawla, nang nuangatsanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin ngaiin, Jeroboam innkuonte tungah sietna ka tungsah dinga, Jeroboam akipat in pasal kichi pouma, Israel gam a mi saltang leh zalen zong, tualeh Jeroboam innkuon umsunte na ngawn zong ka sumang sieng dinga, mi’n eeh aphiet sieng kilkel bang vawt in Jeroboam innkuonte atumgam sieng masang sie uh ka phiet mang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jeroboam innkuonte lah a mi khopi sunga shi pouma ui in ane dinga, tualeh gam a shi pouma tunga leeng va ten ane ding uhi, chia Mangpa’n ana gensa ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin kisa’n len, na inn langah pei kia mai in, tualeh khopi sung na kengin atot tah in, naupang a shi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel mi zousie’n asuun ding ua, avui ding uhi, aziehpen Jeroboam innkuonte lah a ama maimai han a kivui giap ding ahi, Jeroboam innkuonte lah a ama mai mai ah Mangpa Israelte Pasian tunga hoina bang ahiei khat akilat zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaban ah Mangpa’n Israelte tunga leeng ding khat ahing tungdoh dinga, ama’n khum niin Jeroboam innkuonte asumang ding hi; tuin zong bangchi ahita diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi’n tui lah a pumpeng alawling bangmai in Mangpa’n Israelte ahing satling dinga, apulepate uh kunga ana pieh khum gam hoitah a kipat in Israelte abotdoh dinga, tualeh luigal langah athethang ding hi, Mangpa sulungthah dinga Asherte abawl zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Israelte khelna bawlsahpa Jeroboam khelnate ziehin Israelte anuasie ta ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jeroboam zi adingdoh a, apeita a, Tirzah khuo atungta hi, tualeh kotlam atun tahin naupang ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh avui ua, tualeh Mangpa’n asuohpa guolnei Ahijah zanga ana gen bang mama in Israel mi zousien a suun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh Jeroboam silbawl dangte, agaldou dante avaihawm dante, Israel leengte khangthu gelna bu ah atuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Jeroboam vaihawm sung khu kum sawmni leh ni ahia, tuachi’n apulepate kungah a imuta a, tualeh atapa Nadab amathahengin leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Solomon tapa Rehoboam Juda gam ah leeng in apang hi. Lenga apan chiil laiin Rehoboam kum sawmli leh kum khat a upa ahia. Mangpa’n amin umna dinga Israel nam zousie lah a atel khopi Jerusalem ah kum sawm leh sagi leeng in apang hi. Anu min Naamah ahia, Ammon mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judaten Mangpa mitmu in silgilou ahing bawlta ua, apu leh pate uh silbawl zousie khupkhel a, akhelnate un, Athangsietna lungthahna atohthou sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh khu amaun zong muol sang tungte leh sing hing chinteng nuoi ah munsangte milimte leh Asherte abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh khum gam ah pasal kizuate zong aum ua, tualeh Israelte masanga kipata Mangpa’n ana nawdoh namte silbawl kidahhuoi chinteng amaun zong abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Lengpa Rehoboam leenga apan kum ngana kumin hichi ahing hia, Izipt leengpa Shishak in Jerusalem khuo ava sima.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aman Mangpa biehinn a goute leh leengpa inn a goute aunpi’n ala siengta hi, tualeh Solomon in sana abawl lum leh phaw zousie alamang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa Rehoboam in tuate taangin sum-eng in lum leh phaw abawl hi, Tuachi’n leengpa inn kotkhah vengpa lamkaipenpa khut ah akem sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lengpa, Mangpa inn a alut chiengin vengmiten atawi ua, tuachi’n venna pindan ah akoi zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rehoboam tanchin leh asilbawl zousie Juda leengte khangthu gelna laibu ah atuong hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Adam sung tengin Rehoboam leh Jeroboam kikaal ah kidouna aum ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Rehoboam apulepate kungah a imuta a, tualeh David khopi ah apulepate toh avuita uhi. Tualeh anu min Naamah ahia, Ammon mi ahi. Tualeh ama thahengin atapa Abijam leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebat tapa leengpa Jeroboam leenga apan kum sawm leh kum gietna kum in Judate tungah Abijah leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem ah kum thum vai ahawm a, tualeh anu min khu Abishalom tanu Maakah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama masang ah apa’n silgilou abawl zousie aman zong abawl a, apu David lungtang mabangin alungtang Mangpa a Pasian lam ah ahoi kim sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh David ziehin Mangpa a Pasian in ama nua a Jerusalem a vaihawmding leh Jerusalem khuo ding kip sah dingin atapa Abijah apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hit mi Uria tungtang chilou David in Mangpa mitmu in sil dih abawla, adam sung tengin akunga bawl dinga athupiehte zousie aleengatsan ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama damsung tengin Rehoboam leh Jeroboam kikaal ah kidouna aum ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abijah tanchin dangte leh asilbawl zousie Juda leengte vaihawm lai tanchin kigelna laibu sungah atuong hilou ahiei mah? Tualeh Abijah leh Jeroboam kikaal ah kidouna aum zelzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Abijam apu apate kungah a i muta a, tualeh David khopi ah avuita uhi. Tualeh atapa Asa ama thahengin leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Israelte leengpa Jeroboam leenga apan kum sawmni achin kumin, asa khu Judate tungah leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem ah kum sawm li leh khat vai ahawm hi, tualeh api min khu Maakah Abishalom tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Apu David mabangin asa in Mangpa mitmu ah sil hoi abawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman agamsunga kipat in pasal kizua zousie adelmanga, tua leh apa milim bawl zousie asumang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh api Maakah nangawn zong Asher milim kidahhuoi abawl ziehin leengnu nu ahina atawpsahta a, tualeh Asa in a milim bawl asatpua a, Kidron lui ah ahaltumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh munsangte asuse sih a, hinanleh Asa lungtang khu adam sungteng Mangpa lamah ahoi bukim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh apa’n sil ana latsate leh ama mama in alatsa, dangka, sana leh bel leh kuongte Mangpa inn sungah ala lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh adam sung teng uh Asa leh Israel leengpa Baasha akidou ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Israel leengpa Baasha Judate dou dingin ava kuontou a; Juda leengpa Asa kunga lut leh pawt dalna dingin Ramah khuo abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n Asa in Mangpa inn a goute lah a kinuasiete dangka leh sana ala a, asuohte kungah apie a; tualeh Damaska khuo a um Siria leengpa Tabrimon tapa Hezion tupa Benhadad kungah asawl a, akungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na pa leh ka pa kikaal a kilemna ana um bangin kei leh nang kikaal ah zong kilemna umsah vai, chi’n tam kipahman dangka leh sanate kahing hah hi, Israel leengpa Baasha in ahing tawpsan theina dingin ama toh na thuhun suse mai in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Benhadad in Asa leengpa thu ana pom a, tuachi’n Israel khuote dou dingin galkap lamkaite asawl a tuachi’n Izon, Dan, Abel Beth Maakah, Kinneroth gam zousie leh Naphtali gam zousie ava sim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Baasha in tua thu azah tahin, Ramah kho bawl atawpsan a, tuachi’n Tirzah khuo ah aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa Asa in Juda gam sung pumpiah thu aphuonga, koima a awl umtuomlou in, Baasha in Ramah khuo bawlna dinga, sing leh suong azahte anawn ua, tualeh khumte zangin leengpa Asa in Benjamin gam a Geba leh Mizpah khuote abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asa tangthu dang zousie, asilbawltheina zousie leh a khopi bawl zousie, Juda leengte vaihawmna tanchin kigelna laibu sungah atuong hilou ahiei mah? Hinanleh ahing tehsiet bepin akengah hii sie ahing veita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Asa khu apute kungah a i muta a, tualeh David khopi a apu leh pate kungah avuita uhi, tualeh ama thahengin atapa Jehoshaphat leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Judate leengpa Asa leenga apan kum nina in Jeroboam tapa Nadab Israelte tungah kumni leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa mitmu in silhoilou abawl leenga, apa lampi azui a, tuachi’n Israelte akhelsahna, khelna silbawlte khu aman zong abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Issakar innkuonte lah a, Ahijah tapa Baasha in ama tungah thu adap phiela, tuachi’n Baasha in ama Philistinte khuo Gibbethon ah athat a; Nadab leh Israelte zousie in Gibbethon khuo a im laitah uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Juda leengpa Asa leenga apan kum thumna in Baasha in Nadab athat a, ama thahengin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, leenga ahing pan bepin Jeroboam innkuonte zousie athat gam sienga, Jeroboam a dinga hinna nei khat zong ahinkhawipieh sih hi. Mangpa’n Shiloh khomi asuohpa guolnei Ahijah zanga ana gensa mabangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuakhu Israelten sil abawl khielsah na dinga Jeroboam khelnate zieh leh Mangpa Israelte Pasian alungthah sah zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nadab silbawl dangte leh asil bawl zousie Israel leengte khangthu gelna bu ah akigiel hi lou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Asa leh Israelte leengpa Baasha avaihawm sungteng uh akidou ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Juda leengpa Asa leenga apan kum thumna in Ahijah tapa Baasha Tirzah khuo ah Israelte leeng in apang pan a, tualeh kum sawmni le li vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mangpa mitmu in silgilou mamate abawl a, Jeroboam lampi azui a, Israelte khelna abawl sah a, tuabang khelnate abawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachin Baasha tungtang thu ah, Hanani tapa Jehu kungah, Mangpa thu ahing tunga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Leivui akipat in ka hing domsang a, ka mi Israelte tunga leeng in ka hing pang sah a, hinanleh Jeroboam lampi na zui a, akhelnate ua ahing lungthahsahna dingun, ka mi Israelte sil na bawlkhiel sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngaiin, Baasha leh a innkuonte ka sumang ding hi; tualeh na innkuonte zong Nebat tapa Jeroboam innkuonte bangin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Baasha innkuonte lah a mi khopi sunga shi poumate ui in ane dinga; tualeh gamlah a shi poumate tungleeng vaten ane ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baasha na sep dangte, asilbawlte, athahatdante Israel leengte khangthu gelna bu ah atuong hilou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Baasha apute kungah a imuta a, Tirzah khuo ah avui uhi. Tuachi’n ama thahengin atapa Elah leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Baasha leh a innkuonte tungtang thu ah, Jeroboam innkuonte mabanga Mangpa mitmu a sil hoilou ana bawl zousie leh akhut nasep a Mangpa asuhlungthah zieh leh ama atha ziehin Hanani tapa Jehu zanga agen Mangpa thu ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda leengpa Asa leenga apan kum, kum sawmni leh guhna ah Baasha tapa Elah Tirzah khuo ah Israelte tungah kum ni leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh asuohpa Zimri asakolleng kimkhat tunga lamkai pa’n ama tungah aguh in thu aphiel a, khumbang hun laitahin ama Tirzah khuo a, a inn sung lam kemte lamkai lien Arzah innah zu adawn kham a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Judate leengpa Asa leenga apan kum sawmni leh sagina kum in Zimri ava lut a, asat a, a thatta hi, tuachi’n ama taangin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hia, leeng in ahing panga, leengtoupha a ahing tou tahin, Baasha innkuonte zousie athat gam sienga, atanaute leh alawmte lah a mi pasal pouma khat zong ahinkhawi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Jehu zanga Baasha tungtang thu Mangpa’n ana gen dungzui in Zimri in Baasha innkuonte asumang siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aginatlounate zieh ua Israelte Mangpa Pasian sulungthahin, Baasha khelnate zousie leh atapa Elah khelnate in Israelte abawlkhielsah zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ela tangthu dangte leh a silbawl zousie, Israel leengte khangthu kigelna laibu sungah atuong sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Juda leengpa Asa leenga apan kum sawmni leh sagi achin kum in Zimri Tirzah khuo ah ni sagi leeng in apang hi. Tualeh miten Philistinte gam Gibbethon khuo dou dingin panmun abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh panmun bawl miten “Zimri in leengpa aguhin aphiel dapa, athatta” chi ana za ua, tuaziehin Israel mi zousie in, khum niin apan mun ua galkap lamkai Omri khu Israelte leengpa dingin abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Omri khu akunga um Israelte zousie toh Gibbethon akipat akuontou ua, Tirzah khuo ava bu imta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahia, khuo alata uh chi Zimri in atheitah in, leengpa inn kulpi ah atailut a, leengpa inn toh mei in akibuhal khuma ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa mitmu a sil hoilou abawl a akhelnate zieh leh Jeroboam lampi zui a Israelte sil abawl khielsah zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zimri tangthu dangte leh a phiel dapna thute Israel leengte khangthu kigelna laibu ah atuong hilou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel mite pawl ni in ahing kikhenta ua, mipi pawl khat in Ginath tapa Tibni leeng dinga bawl tumin azui ua, tualeh kimkhat in Omri azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Omri zui miten Ginath tapa Tibni zuite azou ua, tuachi’n Tibni ashi a, Omri leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Juda leengpa Asa leenga apan kum sawmthum leh khat kum in Omri Israelte tungah leeng in apang a, Tirzah khuo ah kum guh sung leeng vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh aman dangka talent ni in Shemer a pat in Samaria muol alei a, tualeh muol tungah khuo abawl a, akhomin dingin amuol neipa Shemer min louin Samaria ahi sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh Omri in Mangpa mitmu in sil hoilou abawl zel a, amasanga mi zousiete sangin agilouzaw sem nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aziehpen Nebat tapa Jeroboam lampi azui a, aginatlou zieh ua Mangpa Israelte Pasian lungthahsah dingin ana gilou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Omri silbawl dangte, asilbawltheidan ana suhlat thute Israel leengte khangthu gelna bu ah atuong sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Omri apu apate kungah a i muta a, Samaria khopi ah avuita uhi, tualeh atapa ama thahengin leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Juda leengpa Asa leenga apan kum sawmthum leh kum gietna kumin Omri tapa Ahab Israelte leeng in apang hi. Tualeh Omri tapa Ahab in Samaria khopi ah kum sawmni leh kum ni sung leeng vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Omri tapa Ahab in ama masanga mite zousie sangin Mangpa mitmu ah silhoilou mama abawl zing hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahi a, Nebat tapa Jeroboam khelnate banga gamtat khu bangma thama ngailou in Sidon leengpa Ethbal tanu Jezebel zi in anei a, Baal nnate sem in abeta mawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samaria khopi a Baal inn abawl ah, Baal adingin maitam khat abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahab in Asher abawl a, tuachi’n ama masanga Israel leengte tengteng sangin Ahab in Mangpa Israelte Pasian lungthah sahna sil atam bawl zaw dieh nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahab leenga apan hun sungin Bethel mi Hiel in Jerikou alamtha a, atachil Abiram taan in asuongphum alem a, tualeh atapa tumpen Segub taanin kulkotkhate atungdoh hi. Nun tapa Joshua zanga Mangpa’n ana gensa mabangin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gilead gam a Tishbe khuo a mi Elijah in Ahab kungah “Amasanga ka din zingna pa Israelte Mangpa Pasian min lou in ka gen ahi, kum bangza ahiei sung ka thulouin daitui ahiei guo ahiei ake sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu akungah ahing tunga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tana kipat pawt inlen suolam ah kihei inlen, Jordan lui a luongsuh Kerith luita pang ah vakibu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahi dinga, tua lui tui na dawn dinga, tualeh tuamun a nangma hing vah dingin va-ahte thu ka pe zouta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n apei a, Mangpa thu bangin ava kibuta hi. Jordan lui a luongsuh Kerith luita pangah ava umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n va-ah ten zingmawng lamin tanghou leh sa ava puoh zel ua, nitah lam chiengin zong tanghou leh sa ava puoh zel uhi, tualeh luitui adawn zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh hun tomkhat zou in hichi ahing ahia, gam sunga guo azuhlou ziehin tua lui tui ahing kangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu akungah ahing tunga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Dingdoh inlen Sidon gam a Zarephath khuo ah va pei inlen, khunah va um in, En in, nangma hing vaa dingin meithai khat thu ka pe zouta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n ading doh a Zarephath khuo ah apeita hi. Tualeh khum khopi kulkotpi atun tah in, ngai in meithainu khat singkang tom in ana um a. Tualeh amanu ahan a, “Hepitahin ka dawn ding tui nou khat hing tawiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh tui la dinga kuon lai ahan a, akungah “Tanghou neukhat zong hing tawiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh meithainu’n akungah, “Mangpa na Pasian min louin ka gen ahi, tanghou ka nei sih a hinanleh bel sungah tangbuong sip khat, leh a uum sungah sathau tawmnoukhat ka nei hi; tualeh en in, ka pei chienga kei leh ka tapa ading kanna dingin singkang ni tou khat ka tom a, tuachi’n kane ding ua, ka shi suh mai ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Elijah in akungah “Zausin, pei inlen na chi bangin va bawlin; hinanleh kei a dingin tanghou themnoukhat hing bawl pieh masa inlen, hing tawiin; tuazou chiengin nang leh na tapa adingin bawlin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa Israelte Pasian in tambangin agen hi; Mangpa’n leitunga guo ahing zuhsah masangsie’n, tangbuong bel ahawm ngai sih ding a, tualeh sathau uum zong akang ngai sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu apei a, Elijah gen bangbangin ava bawl a; amaute gel leh ainnkuonten nitampi aneta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Elijah zanga ana gen Mangpa thu dungzuiin tangbuong bel lah ahawm ngai sih a, sathau uum zong akang ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu’n tambang teng a hing hi nua in, inn neinu, numei tapa achi ahing nata a. China ahing gim mama ta a, anaah atawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amanu’n Elijah kungah, “Aw nang Pasian mipa, ka tunga na lung himawna bang ahiei? ka khelnate hing theidoh sah ding leh ka tapa hing thalia pieh dinga hing pei na! hiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh amapa’n a kungah, “Na tapa hingpe vawi” achia, tuachi’n apomlai alahpieh a, ama umna pindan tung ah apomtou a, ama lupna tung vateh ah a siel hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa han in akikou a, “Aw Mangpa ka Pasian, ka umna meithainu tungah zong, atapa that a chimawna tungsah ding na hiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n naupang tungah thumvei akhupboh a, Mangpa ahan a, “Aw Mangpa ka Pasian, hepitahin tam naupang hinna, ama sungah hing umsah kia in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Elijah kikou aw a zata a; tuachi’n naupang hinna ama ah ahing um kia a, ahing haldohkia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuabepin Elijah in naupang khu ala a, ama pindan akipat in inn sungah azawpi suh a, anu apie hi, tuachi’n Elijah in, “En in, na tapa adam kiata hi!” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n numei in Elijah kungah, “Tuin vang tami ziehin Pasian mi na hi chi leh, na kam a Mangpa thupawt khu thutah ahi chi ka thei chienta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh nitampi nua in hichi ahing hia, khokhal kum thum chin kumin Elijah kungah Mangpa thu ahing tunga, “Pei inlen Ahab kungah vakilang inlen leitung ah guo hing zusah ding ka hi,” vachi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah khu Ahab toh kimu dingin akuonta hi. Tualeh Samaria khopi ah kiel anase mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Ahab in a innsung vaihawmpa Obadiah ahan a; Obadiah khu Pasian giing mi ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen hichi ahi a, Jezebel in Mangpa guolneite abantha lai in, Obadiah in guolnei za khat azawpi a, sawm nga nga in leihawm ah aphuol a, tanghou leh tui in avaa zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahab in Obadiah kungah, “Pei inlen gamsunga tuinah umnate, luita dung zousie va sui vawiin, sakol leh sabiltungte i huhhing theina dingin loupa imu pieh thei kha ei mah, tuachilouin gantate itaan sieng kha ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n gam totsuoh ding akihawm ua, Ahab pen lampi dang khatah amatangin apei a, tualeh Obadiah zong amatang ma in lampi dang khat ah apei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachia Obadiah apei laiin, Elijah toh thakhat in akituoh ua; Obadiah in ama atheina lai a, tuachi’n akhupboha akungah, “Ka pu Elijah hina teh izaw?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah in adawnga, “Ka hina hi, Pei inlen, Elijah tanah aum hi chiin na pu vahil in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh aman akungah, “Bang khelna ka nei a, na suoh Ahab kunga ahing tha dinga, na hing pieh khiet ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian hinna louin ka gen ahi, ka puin nang ahing suisah louna nam leh gam mawngmawng a um sih hi. Tanah aum sih achi chiengun nang ahing mulouna thu uah gam leh namte akichiemsah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin nang kuon inlen, “Elijah tanah aum hi” chiin na pu va hilin nachi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi dinga, Nang ka hing nuasie tahin, Mangpa Hagau in ka theilouna mun khat ah ahing na lamang dinga; tuachia Ahab kava hil ngal a, nang ahing muthei sih leh vang, kei hing that mai ding ahi; hinanleh na suohpa in ka tangvalnou apat in Mangpa zaudan siem zingmi ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jezebel in Mangpa guolneite abantha lai a, ka silbawl Mangpa guolneite za khat, sawmnga nga leihawm sunga tanghou leh tui a kava dante ka pu kunga hing hillou uh ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin nang pei inlen, “Ngai in Elijah tanah aum hi chi’n napu vahil in nang chi mawh a, ahing na that ngeingei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah in akungah “Amasanga kadin zingna galkapte Mangpa hinna louin ka gen ahi, tunin akungah keima ngel ka kilah ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Obadiah Ahab houpi dingin akuon a, ava hilta a; tuachi’n Ahab Elijah mu tumin akuon kheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hia, Ahab in Elijah ava mu laitahin, Ahab in akungah “Nang hite izaw, Israelte subuoipa?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Elijah in adawnga, “Ken Israelte ka subuoi sih a, hinanleh nang leh na pa innkuonten na suhbuoi uh ahi zawbou hi; Mangpa thupiehte na taisan ua, Baal na zui zieh uh, ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, Israel mite zousie leh Baal guolnei zali leh sawm ngate tualeh Asher guolnei Jezebel dawkan a annkuong iim zelzel zali te ka kunga Karmel muol ah va hankhawm in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahab in Israel tate zousie kungah mi asawl a, Karmel muol ah guolneite ahankhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Elijah in mipite zousie anai a, akung uah, “Ngaidan ni saikah a, avanglah a bang tan vei um ding na hi uoi? Mangpa khu Pasian ahi leh zui unlen; hinanleh Baal ahilelah ama zui zaw un,” achi hi. Mipiten kamkhat in zong adawng sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah in mipite kungah, “Mangpa guolnei umsun kei maimai ka hi a; Baal guolneite zali leh sawmnga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin bawngtal ni hing pie unlen; tualeh amaun atan dingun bawng khat tel u’henlen, satguoi dil del uhenlen, sing tungah koi u’henlen, anuoi a mei tawlou in; tuachi’n akhat pen ken ka bawl dinga, singtungah ka koi dinga, anuoi ah mei ka koi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n nouten na pasiente uh min han unlen, tualeh ken zong Mangpa min ka han ding hi; tuachi’n mei a hing dawng Pasian penpen Pasian hi heh,” achi hi. Tualeh mi zousie’n “Na gen ahoi hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin Elijah in Baal guolneite kungah, “Bawngtal khat tel unlen bawl masa un, nou atam zaw na hi uhi; tualeh na pasiente uh min han un, ahivangin anuoi ah mei tawsih un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n akung ua kipie bawngtal khu ala ua, asem ua, “Baal aw hing dawngin!” chiin zingmawng a kipat in suntan dongin Baal min ahan uhi, Hinanleh aw zah ding a um sih a; tualeh bangma in adawng tuon sih hi. Tualeh amaitam bawl kim uah akitawm tawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh sun ahing hi bepin hichi ahing ahia, Elijahin amauh a enghou a, akung uah, “Hakou in kikou un, ama pasien ahia, akingaituo tadi ahiei, avahdoh zuai ahiei, khuolzin ahiei, ahisihleh a imu khattou hikha va, phawng unlen khanglou sah teitei un” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n aw ngai sem in akikou ua, abawl ngaina dan bangun, temta leh sia hiem ten si pawt zeng zungin aki-at gawp gawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh ni ahing kaai bepin hichi ahing ahia, nitah lam kithoi hun tandongin thu aphuong nalai ua, hinanleh dawnna aw mawngmawng a um sih a, dawngding leh ngaisahding mawngmawng zong aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah in mipi zousiete kungah, “Hing kikhin nai vawi un,” achia, tuachi’n mipiten a kunglam ahing zuon ta uhi. Tualeh aman Mangpa maitam chimzousa a siempha kia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh na min “Israel ahi ding” chia Mangpa thu tunna Jakob tapate nam za suong sawm leh ni ala a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua suongte in Mangpa min in maitam abawl a, Tualeh maitam kimkot ah buchi tena ni dawla lien in lei atou kuoh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh ahi ding bangtahin sing achieng khawm a, bawngtal asem neen a, sing tungah akoi a, tualeh “Bel li tuiin dim sah unlen, halmang sillat leh singte buoh khum un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh “Buoh kia un” achia, tuachi’n abuoh kia ua; tualeh athum veina dingin “Buoh kia nalai un” achi a, tuachi’n athum veina dingin “Tui abuohbe nalai” uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuachi’n maitam kimkot ah tui aluonga, lei kitou kuoh ah avei denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh nitahlam kithoina lat hun laiin hichi ahing ahia, guolnei Elijah in maitam ava nai a, “Aw Mangpa Abraham, Issak leh Israel Pasian, Nang Israel gam a Pasian Na hi leh kei na suohpa ka hi dan leh tam silte Nangma thu a ka bawl ahi chi tuni’n thei chienta uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aw Mangpa, hing ngai khie inlen, ka thumna hing sanpieh in, Tam miten Nangma khu Mangpa Pasian na hia, alungtangte uh Nangma lam ah Na kileheisah kiata hi chi athei theina dingun,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa mei ahing kie a, halmang kithoina sillatte, singte, suongte, leivuite akatum sienga, tualeh lei tawkuoh sunga tuite zong atawp kangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mipi zousie in tuakhu amutahun, akhupboh ua, “Mangpa Ama khu Pasian ahi, Mangpa Ama khu Pasian ahi,” achita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh Elijah in akung uah, “Baal guolneite man unlen khat beh zong suohta sah sih un” achi hi. Tuachi’n aman ua, Elijah in kishon lui ah azawpi suh a khunah amaute athatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elijah in Ahab kungah, “Va peitou inlen ne in va dawn in, guo tampi zu ding husa a um hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ahab khu ne ding leh dawn dingin apeitou a, tualeh Elijah zong Karmel muolvum ah apeitou a, tualeh tuol ah akun suh a, akhuptegel kikal ah amai akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Asuohpa kungah, “Peitou inlen tuipi lang va enta vawi,” achia, tuachi’n apeitou a ava en a; “Bangma a um sih hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Elijah in “Sagi vei kuon inlen va en in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuachi’n a sagi veina in hichi ahing ahia, Tuanah “Tuipi akipat in meilum khal mihing khuttum chie khat, aleengtou vi-viei hi, achia. Tualeh ama’n va peitou inlen Ahab kungah, na sakolleng bawl inlen, pei suh tain, guo in ahing lap kha ding hi,” vachiin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tualeh tomkhat kallou in van khu meipi leh hui in adup kei kuita a, guopi thupi tah ahing zuta hi. Tuachi’n Ahab a sakolleng tunga tuongin Jezreel khuo ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa khut Elijah tungah aum a; tuachi’n apuon atenga Ahab masangah Jezreel kholutna tandong ataita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Ahab in Elijah sil bawl zousie, namsau a guolnei zousie atha thu Jezebel ahilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jezebel in Elijah kungah, mi asawl a, “Zingchieng tuhun vel a na hinna amau’lah a mi khat hinna banga ka bawl sih leh pasienten alaw law uh hing law u’henlen tua sanga zong nase zaw in zong,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh khum thu athei bepin adingdoh a, ahinna humbit tumin ataita a, Juda gam a Beer-Sheba khuo ava tunga, khunah a suohpa anuasieta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh amatangin gamdai ni khat lam ah apei a, luonglau phung nuoi khat ah atou a, tualeh shi angenta hi, “Ahunta hi, Mangpa aw, tuin ka hinna la maita in, ka pute sang in lah ka hoizaw tuom sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n luonglau phung nuoi ah alum a, a i mut laiin, ngai in bakhat loukal in vansawlsiengin ama ahing khoi a, akungah “Thou inlen ne in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n a en a, aluhung ah suongsa tunga ki em minsa tanghou leh tuithawl ana um a, tuachi’n ane a, adawn a, alum kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa vansawlsieng ahing pei kia a, ama akhoikia a, akungah “Thou inlen ne in, na peina ding nanga dingin ahasa seng hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh athou a ann ane a tui adawn a, tua a ann neh huvangin ni sawm li leh zan sawmli ving veng lam apei zou a, Pasian muol Horeb atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khunah suongkohawm sung khat ah alut a, azan giehta hi; Tualeh ngai vawi, Mangpa thu akungah ahing tunga, “Elijah tamna bang bawl na hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akungah, “Mangpa galkapte Pasian adingin phatuom ka ngai mama a, aziehpen Israel taten lah na thuhun a leengatsan ta ua, na maitamte achim sah ua, na guolneite namsau in asatlia ta ua, aum sun kei mai mai ka hita hi, kei nangawn hing tha tum in ahing sui uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n akungah, “Pawt inlen Mangpa masangah khuna muol tungah va dingin,” achi hi. Tualeh ngai in, Mangpa khu ahing pei a, huipi hattah in muol leh taangte a sem khipoh a, Mangpa masangah suongpite apawhkeh ua, hinanleh hui lah ah Mangpa aum sih a, tualeh hui lanzou in zil ahing kilinga, hinanleh zil ling lah ah zong Mangpa aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zil lin zou in meikuong ahing pawt a, hinanleh meikuong ah Mangpa a um sih, tualeh meikuong nua ah, aw ngat ngiungeu khat ahing pawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahi a, Elijah in tuakhu azahtah in, apuonin amai akhu a, ava pawtdoh a, suonghawm lutna kot ah ava dinga, tualeh aw in thakhat in, “Elijah, tanah bang bawl na hiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Galkapte Mangpa Pasian a dingin phatuom ka ngai mama zela, Aziehpen Israel taten lah na thuhun ale-ngatsan ua, na maitamte asuchim ua, na guolneite namsau in asatlum siengta ua, aum sun kei ka hi a, ka hinna lah tumin ahing sui uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n akungah, “Peikia inlen Damaska gamdai lampi lang ah nua kiata in; tualeh na tun chiengin, Siria leengpa dingin Hazael sathau nu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Nimsi tapa Jehu Israel leengpa dingin sathau nu inlen, tualeh nangma thahenga guolnei a pang dingin Abel-meholah khuo a Shaphat tapa Elisha sathau nu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hidinga, Hazael namsau a kipat suohta pouma Jehu namsau in athat ding; tualeh Jehu namsau akipat suohta pouma, Elisha in athat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel gam ah, Baal masanga khupdin ngai nailou leh ama tawp kha ngai nailou mi tul sagi kei a dingin ka koi nalai hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n khuna kipat apawtkhie a, Shaphat tapa Elisha ava mudoh a, aman bawngtal kop sawm leh ni masot a lou kaiin ana um a, asawm leh nina ama’n ana hawla, tualeh Elijah ava pei a, apuon ava se khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh aman bawngtalte anua sie a, Elijah anuadel a, akungah “Ka nu leh ka pa kava tawp phot dinga, tuazou chiengin ka hing zui ding,” achia, tualeh aman “Nua pei kia ta’n, ken bang kang law a ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elisha ama nua zui lai anua kia kia a, bawngtal kopkhat ahawl a, agou a, abawng vante in ahuon a, mipite kungah apie a, aneta uhi. Tuachi’n adingdoh a, Elijah nua zui a, ana asep piehta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siria leengpa Benhadad in agalkapte zousie akaikhawm a, ama lam ah leeng sawmthum leni apang ua, sakol leh sakolleng toh akuontou ua, Samaria khuo ava im a, asimta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n khopi sunga Israel leengpa Ahab kungah mi asawl a, akungah Benhadad in “Tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na dangka leh sana teng kei a ahia, na zite, na tate tualeh na nei hoipente zong kei a ahita chiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa’n adawnga, akungah, “Ka pu, Aw leengpa’n, na chi mabangin ka nei zousie toh nanga ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n ami sawlte ahing pei kia ua, a kungah “Benhadad in tambangin agen hi. “Na dangkate, na sanate, na zite, na tate nang pieh ding ahi,” chitanan leeng zong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zing chieng tubang hun ding velin ka mite na kungah ka hing sawl dinga, na innsung leh na mite inn sung along ding ua, hoi na sah pouma akhut un ala ding ua, apomang ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa’n agam sunga upate zousie ahankhawm a, akung uah, “Tam mipan sil hoiloutah bawl atupdan na thei chiet ua, ka kungah mi ahing sawl a, ka zite, ka tate, ka dangkate leh ka sanate ahing ngen a, aniel ding zong lah hilou ing a,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh a upate zousie leh mipite zousiein akungah, “Ngaisah sinlen, lem zong sahpi sin,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Benhadad mi sawlte kungah, “Kapu leengpa kungah, Na suohpa kunga mi sawl a na hing nget masah teng bangin bawlvangin hinanleh tam sil penvang ka bawl thei sih ding achi hi,” chi’n va hil un, achi hi. Tualeh ami sawlte apei ua, thu ava tut kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Benhadad in akungah mi asawl kia a, “Ka nuazuite zousie in a khut dim a aham khop chiet uh zong Samaria khopi leivui ka khawipieh leh pasienten alaw law hinglaw uhenlen tuasanga nase zawin zong hing bawl mai heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa’n adawnga, akungah, “Mi galvan toh kivonlai kisuokhia bang zen in kiuongsah sih heh, chiin vahil un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Benhadad in tam thu khu leeng dangte toh pindan sunga zu ana dawn khawm laiun ana za a, tualeh amite kungah “Kisa un,” achia, tuachi’n khum khopi dou dingin akisata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum hunlaitahin guolnei khat Israel leengpa Ahab kungah ahing pei a, akungah, “Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi; Tam mipi tampite na mu ei? Ngai in tamte tuni’n na khut ah ka hing pekhe ding hi, tuachi’n kei Mangpa ka hi chi na hing thei ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Ahab in akungah, “Koi zang in lah?” achia, tualeh aman adawnga, “Mangpa’n hichiin achi hi,” gamkai a miliente tangvalte zangin achi hi. Tuachi’n leengpa’n kidouna “Koi in apan diei?” achi kia a, Tualeh aman adawnga, “Nangman,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamkai lamkai miliente tangvalte asim a, zani leh sawm thum leh ni ahi ua, tuazouin mipite asim ua, Israel tate zousie tul sagi apha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n sunlaitah in akuon khie ua, tuahun laitahin Benhadad leh ama panpi leeng sawmthum leh nite khu thupiehna buh sungah zudawnkham in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gamkaite a lamkai tangvalte akuondoh masa ua. Tualeh Ben-Hadad in enkhe dingin mi asawl a, tualeh amaun, “Samaria khopi apat in mite ahing pawtdoh uhi,” chi’n ahil ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman, “Kilemna bawl tum a hing pawtdoh ahi u’leh ahing in na man unlen, kidou dinga hing pawtdoh ahi u’leh zong ahing ma in na man un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n tam gamkai a lamkai milien tangvalte khu khopi akipat amauh nuazui galkapte toh apawtdoh ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Michin in amauh kituohpi chiet athat ua, tuachi’n Siriate ataizah ua, Israelten anuadel ua, Tualeh Siria leengpa Ben-Hadad khu sakol tungah sakol tungtuong mite toh asuohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa akuon a, sakol leh sakollengte ava dou a, tualeh Siria mite tampi ava that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Israel leengpa kungah guolnei ahing pei a, akungah “Pei inlen, ki suhat inlen; na bawl dan ding en in, chiemte inlen theiin, aziehpen, kum kihei a khallai ahing hi kia chiengin Siria leengpa’n hing dou kia ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siria leengpa suohten akungah, “Apasiente u’khu singtang gam pasiente ahi ua, tuazieh a ei sanga hatzaw ahi ua, hinanleh phaijang ah kidou lei vang ama u’sangin ihat zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin tambangin bawl in: leengte apan mun ua kipat tawpsah inlen, amauh mun ah galkap lamkaite koi inlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh na mansuo sa, galkapte, sakolte, sakollengte, sim inlen, na mansuo za za alien galkap pawl dingdoh sah kia inlen; tuachi’n phaijang ah idou ding ua, ihat zaw ngei ngei ding uhi,” achi ua; tuachi’n athu gen uh atahsang a, tuabangin abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh akum kia khallai ahing hi kia tahin Ben-Hadad in Siriate akhawmkhawm a, Israelte dou dingin Aphek khuo ah akuontou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate zong akikhawm ua, neh ding kengin Siriate dou dingin akuonta uhi. Israel tate khu amasang uah kelhon tawmnoukhat hon nia, kisuo bangin giehphuol asat nimnem ua, hinanleh Siriaten agam alei atuom suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian mi khat ahing pei a Israel leengpa ahoupi a, akungah “Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, Siriate’n “Mangpa khu singtang gam Pasian ahia, phaijang Pasian ahi sih” achi ua, tuaziehin, tana mipi tamtahte khu na khut ah ka hing pekhe dinga, tuachi’n Mangpa ka hi chi nang thei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n ni sagi sung kimaituo in akingimtuo ua, tualeh ani sagi niin akidouta ua, tualeh Israel taten Siria galkapte nikhat in tul zakhat athat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh adangte Aphek ah atai ua, khopi sung ah alut ua, tualeh a um sun mi tul sawmni leh tul sagite kulpi bangin achip khum hi. Tualeh Ben-Hadad ataimanga, khopi sunga inndan sung gil khat ah atai lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh asuohten akungah, “Ngai in, tuin Israel innkuonte lah a leengte khu mi lungsiet siemtah leengpate ahi uh chi ka za uhi, tuaziehin sai ip puon tengin ka lu ua khau a kikhi in Israel leengpa kungah hing va hawsah in, aman na hinna ahing khawi pieh nuom khamaw sih ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n sai ip puon ateng ua, alutang uah khau akikhi ua, Israel leengpa kungah ava hawta uhi, akungah, “Na suohpa Ben-Hadad in, hepitahin hing hinkhawi heh achi hi,” achi ua, tualeh ama’n “Dam nalai hi maw, ama ka unaupa ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua miten lungnuom tahin alungsim thu tah agen hinava chi gingtain, “Na unaupa Ben-Hadad hima e” achi pai uhi. Tuachi’n aman “Pei unlen hing zawpi un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Ben-Hadad ahing pawtkhie a, akungah ahing pei a, tuachi’n aman sakolleeng tungah ana tuongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ben-Hadad in akungah, “Ka pa’n napa akipat a khopi ana lahte ka hing pekia dinga, tualeh ka pan Samaria khopi sunga summet bawlna munte abawl bangin nang zong Damaska khopi sungah summet bawlna munte na bawl ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Ahab in “Tuabang a thuhun bawlin ka hing pei sah ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n ama toh thuhun abawla apei sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Guolnei tapate lah a koi ahiei khat in, Mangpa thu in a innvengpa kungah, “Hing sat in” achi a. Tuapan asat nuom sih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akungah “Mangpa thu na man lou ziehin, ngai in kei apata na peidoh hun hun chiengin humpibahnei khat in ahing that ding hi,” achi hi. Tualeh apeidoh tahin humpibahnei khat in ana mu a, athatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n midang khat ava mu a, akungah “Hepitahin hing sat in,” achi a. Tuachi’n ana sat a, asat liemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua guolneipa apawtdoh a, lampi ah leengpa ngah in ana dinga, atal gahna diel in amit khusahin ana kisiem lamdang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lengpa lampi a ahing peitahin, ana han a, akungah “Kei na suohpa kidouna phuol sungah kava haw a; tualeh ngai in mi khat hing kihei in, mi khat ka kungah ahing zawpi a, tam mipa na vengin ataimang leh ahinna taangin na hinna na taan dinga, ahisihleh dangka talent khat na lieu ding ahi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kei na suohpa ka pum buoi lahkal in ana peimangta hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Israel leengpa’n akungah, “Tuabang lien in, na tung thu nangman na kikhenta hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman “Amit akipat atal gahna alem zuai a, tuachi’n Israelte leengpa’n guolneite lah a mi khat ahi chi atheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Aman leengpa kungah, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: suhmang ding a ka hamsiet sa na hakia zieh in ahinna taangin na hinna, amipi taangin na mipite na taan ding hi, chiin ahing chi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuaziehin Israelte leengpa khu nguitah leh lungkimlou tah mai in Samaria khopi a a inn ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tam silte nuain hichi ahing ahia, Jezreel khuo a um Naboth in, grep huon khat anei a tuakhu Jezreel kho sunga Samaria leengpa Ahab leeng inn kung nai a um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahab in Naboth ahoupi a, akungah “Ka inn gei taha um ahi ziehin, annte louhing huon dingin na grep huon hing pie in, tualeh tami sanga hoizaw grep huon hing pe na vang ahisihleh hoi nasah zawh leh zong aman akituoh nasah zaza asum in ka hing pe mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Naboth in Ahab kungah, “Kapu ka pate gou nang kunga ka hing pieh ding Mangpa’n aphal sih hi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jezreel mi Naboth in, tuabanga thu akunga agen ziehin Ahab khu nguitah leh lungkimlou tahin a inn langah apeita hi; “Ka pute gou kang pe thei sih ding” ana chi chinten hi. Tuachi’n alupna tungah alum a, alelam anga a, ann zong ane nuomta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azi Jezebel akungah ahing pei a, “Bang zieh a hichi lungkham na hiei ann leh tui nelou a na um tah lawm?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman azi kungah “Jezreel mi Naboth ka houpi a, akungah na grep huon hing lei sahin ahisihleh pha nasah leh ataangin grep huon dang khat ka hing pe mai ding hi ka chi leh, ama’n ka grep huon kang pe thei sih ding chi’n ahing dawng hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n azi Jezebel in akungah, “Israelte tunga na thuneina tambang giap ahiei mah? Thou inlen ann ne inlen na lungsim kipah sah in; Jezreel mi Naboth grephuon khu keiman hingpe navang” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahab min in lai agiel a, asuoi namna in anam a, tualeh Naboth tenna khopi a milien te leh upate kungah ahah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Alaihah ann ngawl thu na phuong unlen, “Mipi lah ah Naboth sang tahin na koi unlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migilou thugen siem ni Naboth mai ah tousah unlen, Pasian leh leengpa na gensie hi chia theipitu dingin bawl un. Tuachi’n Naboth puidoh unlen suongin seplum un” chi’n agiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n atenna khopi mite, akhopi sunga teng upate leh milienten Jezebel in akung ua alaihah a agel bangin abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ann ngawl thu aphuong ua, Naboth zatatna mun sang ah mipite lah ah atousah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Migilou thugen siem ni ahing pei ua, amai ah atouta uhi, tualeh Migiloute gel in mipite masang ah, “Naboth in Pasian leh leengpa agensie hi” chiin ahehta uhi. Tuachi’n khopi akipat azawpi ua, khopi pulam ah suongin a sep ua, ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jezebel kungah mi asawl ua, “Naboth suongin akisep a ashita hi,” chi’n thu ava tutsahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jezebel in Naboth suongin asep ua ashita chi azah tahin, Jezebel in Ahab kungah, “Thou inlen, Jezreel mi Naboth grephuon ahing leisah nuomlou khu va neita in, aziehpen Naboth ahing nawn sih a, ashita hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachia Ahab in Naboth ashita chi azah bepin Jezreel mi Naboth grephuon vala a tang dingin kuon suh asawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu khu Tishbe mi Elijah kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thou inlen Samaria khopi a um Israel leengpa Ahab kimupi dingin kuon suhin. Naboth grep huon ah aum a, tuakhu nei tum a pei suh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Akungah Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, “Na that a, ahuon lahpieh nalai ding na hiei?” achi hi. Tualeh Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, Naboth sisan ui ten aliehna mun ngei ah, Nangma sisan zong ui ten alieh ding hi, chiin akung ah va gen in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahab in Elijah kungah, “Na hing mudoh ta maw, Aw ka melma pa?” achi hi. Tualeh aman adawng a, “Ka hing muta hi; Mangpa mitmu a sil hoilou bawl dinga na kizuataah ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngai in, na tungah sietna ka hing tungsah dinga, tualeh nangma kang phietmang dinga, Ahab akipata ta pasal pouma Israel gam a saltang hi in, zalen hitaleh ka sumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangma’n na hing lungthah sah a, Israelte khelna na bawl sah ziehin na innsung khu Nebat tapa Jeroboam innkuonte leh Ahijah tapa Baasha innkuonte bangin ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Jezebel tungtang thu zong Mangpa’n agen a, Jezreel kulpi bang gei ah uiten Jezebel ane ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahab innkuonte lah a mi khopi sung a shi pouma te uiten ane ding a, tualeh gam a shi poumate lah tungleeng vaten ane ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh azi Jezebel in a chiil sietna zieh a Mangpa mitmu a silgilou bawl dinga, apuma kizua Ahab bang lawmlawm koima dang aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel tate masanga Mangpa’n ana nawdoh Amorte gamtat mabangin milim kidahhuoite azui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahab in khum thute azah tahin, a puonte abotkeh a, ann ngawl in sai ip puon asila, tualeh sai ip puon toh alum a, kingiemkhieh tahin apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa thu Tishbe mi Elijah kungah ahing tunga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ka masanga Ahab kingaingiem khu na mu ei? ka masanga akingai ngiem ziehin khum silhoilou ama dam sungin ka tung sah sih dinga, hinanleh tua sil hoiloute atapa khangin a innkuonte tungah ka tungsah ding hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n kum thum sung, Siria gam leh Israel gam kidou louin aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh akum thumna in, Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat Israel leengpa kungah ava hawsuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Israel leengpa’n asuohte kungah, “Gilead gam a Ramoth ei a hinapi a, hinanleh tutan a Siria leengpa khut a kipat a lahpieh nuomlou a i um na thei uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Jehoshaphat kungah, “Ramoth Gilead a galdoudingin ka kungah nang kuon diei?” achi hi. Tualeh Jehoshaphatin, Israel leengpa kungah, “Kei leh nang, ka mite leh na mite pumkhat ihi ua, ka sakol leh na sakol zong pumkhat ahi ve uo le” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Jehoshaphat in Israel leengpa kungah, “Mangpa thu tuni’n hungaitadi in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa’n guolneite mi zali tah ahankhawm a, akung uah, “Rimoth Gilead khuo dou dingin ka kuon tou diei, ka kuontou sih diei?” achi hi. Tualeh amaun “Kuontou in, Mangpa’n leengpa khut ah ahing pe ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Jehoshaphat in, “I doh thei ding Mangpa guolnei dang Tanah koima um nawnlou ahiei amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel leengpa’n Jehoshaphat kungah, “Mangpa hing doh pieh ding mi khat Imlah tapa Mikaiah a um nalai ma ve, hinanleh ama ka muda mama hi, aziehpen ka tungtang thu aselam loungal ahoilam agen ngai vawt sih hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Jehoshaphat in “Leengpa’n tuabangin thu gen da leh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel leengpa’n amiliente khat ahan a, “Imlah tapa Mikaiah kintahin hing pui in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel leengpa leh Juda leengpa Jehoshaphatte Samaria khopi lutna kotpi kunga phuol zang ah a leeng puonte uh silin, a leengtoupha tuoh uah atou ua, tualeh guolnei zousien amai uah thumavang agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin Kenaanah tapa Zedekiah in sia kiite abawla, Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, “Tam toh Siriate amanthai sieng masangsie un na sun ding, achi hi,” achi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuamabangin guolnei zousie in zong Ramoth Gilead ah, “Va kuontou inlen va lawching in Mangpa’n leengpa khut ah ahing pe ding hi,” achi chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mikaiah han dinga asawlpa un akungah, “Ngai in, tuin guolneite zousie in thu khat a luongkhawmin ahoilam in leengpa kungah thu aphuong chiet ua, nang zong amauh gen mabangin, hepitah in gen mai in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mikaiah in, “Mangpa min in ka gen ahi, Mangpa’n ka kunga agente bou ka gen ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa kung ahing tunga; Lengpa’n akungah “Mikaiah Rimoth Gilead dou dingin ka kuon ding uoi, ka kuon sih ding uoi?” achia, tualeh aman adawnga, “Kuon unlen va lawchingta un, Mangpa’n leengpa khutah ahing pekhe ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n akungah, “Thutah chilou ngal Mangpa min a genlou dingin, bangza vei atai ka hing kichiem sah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman, “Israelte zousie ching ding neilou belam bangin muol le taangte a taizah a kithethang ka mu hi. Mangpa’n Tamten ching ding aneita sih uh, michin ama uh innlam chietah lungmuong tahin pei mai uheh achi hi,” achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Israel leengpa’n Jehoshaphat kungah, “Ka tungtang thu ah aselam loungal, ahoilam mawngmawng agen sih ding, chi ka hing hil hilou ahiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mikaiah in agenbe nalai a, “Tuaziehin Mangpa thu ngaikhe in, Mangpa a Mangtoupha tunga tou ka mu a, van a mipite zousie aziet lam leh avei lam a toute toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n, Ramoth Gilead dou dinga va kuontou a, gal a shi dinga, koi in ahiei Ahab va sol lungdam ding? achi hi. Tualeh khat in thu khat agen a, a dangten thu tuom agen zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n hagau khat ahing pawt a, Mangpa masangah ava dinga, keiman ka sol lungdam ding achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mangpa’n akungah bang na chi sol diei? a chi hi. Tualeh aman kava kuon dinga, aguolneite zousie kam ah zuou gen hagau in kava um ding achi hi. Tualeh Mangpa’n Nang va sol inlen zou zong nava zou ding hi, kuon pai inlen va bawl in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, en in, Mangpa’n tam na guolneite zousie kam ah hagau zuouthei a koia, tualeh Mangpa’n na tungtang thu ahoilou lam in agen zouta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kenaanah tapa Zedekiah in ahing zuon a Mikaiah pheta ava beenga, akungah, “Mangpa Hagau in na kunga thu gen ding, kei heilanga ahing peisan ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Mikaiah in, “Ngai vawi, dantan sunggila kibu dinga na lut ni chiengin na thei ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Israel leengpa’n “Mikaiah man unlen, khopi sung vaipopa Amon leh leengpa tapa Joash kungah peipi kiata un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh leengpa’n hichi bangin achi hi, “Tam mipa suongkul ah khum unlen, lungmuong tah a ka hing pei kia masangsien, gimthuohna ann leh, gimthuohna tui nana pie un, achi hi,” chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Mikaiah in “Lungmuong taha na hing peikia pouma leh Mangpa’n kei hing zanga thu genlou ahi ngei ding,” achi hi. Tualeh ama mama in, “Nou mipite aw, ana ngaikhe chiet ma di uo le,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa leh Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat Ramoth Gilead ah akuontouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Israel leengpa’n Jehoshaphat kungah, “Ka hing kisiem lamdang dinga, tuachi’n kidouna ah ka hing pang ding hi, hinanleh nang pen in na leeng puon hing sil in,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Israel leengpa akisiem lamdanga, kidouna ah akuon touta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh Siria leengpa’n a sakollengte tunga thunei lamkaite sawmthum leh nite kungah “Israel leengpa chiloungal, mineu hiin milien hitaleh koima dou sih un,” chi’n thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n sakollengte tunga lamkaiten, Jehoshaphat amu tah un, “Israel leengpa hiva achi ua, dou tum in a imta ua,” tuachi’n Jehoshaphat akikou kheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh sakolleeng tunga lamkaiten, Israel leengpa ahisih chi athei tah un, ama nuadel lai akinua heisanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh koi ahiei khat in, tup tuom neilou in athalpi aluoi a akap leh Israel leengpa lum kawm kikaal akap kha a, tuachi’n a sakolleeng hawlpa kungah, “Kihei kuol inlen gal phuola kipat hing pawtkhietpi ta’n, ka liemta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khum ni’n kidouna ahuoise mama a, leengpa zong Siriate lang nga in asakolleng ah akingam hi, tuachi’n nitah lam in ashita hi. Tualeh aliemna apat asisan sakolleng sungah hawhtui vei abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua nitum ding kuon in galkapte lah ah, “Michin ama kho lam chiet ah, michin ama gam chiet ah, kipeita heh chiin, kikou a tangtoh na” a um tahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa ashita, a, Samaria khopi ah apolut ua, Tualeh Samaria khopi ah leengpa avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi khat in sakolleng khu Samaria khuo a tuikhuh (numei kizuate kisilna zel) ah ava sawp a tualeh uiten asi ana lieh uhi, Mangpa’n akunga ana gensa mabangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahab tanchin dangte, asilbawl zousiete, asaiha innlamte, akhopi bawl zousiete, Israel leengte khang thu gelna laibu sungah atuong hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuabangin Ahab apulepate kungah a imuta a, tuachi’n atapa Ahajiah ama thahengin leeng in apangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Israelte leengpa Ahab, Israelte tunga leenga apan kum lina kumin Asa tapa Jehoshaphat Juda leengpa in ahing pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jehoshaphat leenga ahing pan chiil lai in kum sawmthum leh kum nga ahia, Jerusalem ah kum sawmni leh nga, leeng in apanga, tualeh anu min Azubah ahia, Shilhi tanu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tualeh apa Asa lampite azui a, Mangpa mitmuin sil hoi leh dih abawla, aleengatsan sih hi. Hinanleh munsangte asuse sih hi, aziehpen mipiten munsangte ah sil alan ua, gimnamtui ahal zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh Jehoshaphat in Israel leengpa toh zong kilemna thuhun ahung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jehoshaphat tanchin dangte, asilbawltheidan atahlat thute, agaldou thute, Juda leengte khangthu gelna laibu sungah atuong sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tualeh apa Asa damlai a, pasal kizua um sunte agam apat in adelmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Khum hunlai in Edom gam ah leengpa aum sih a, uhpipa ten leeng vai ahawm mai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jehoshaphat in Ophir a sana po dingin summet bawlna tembawte abawla, hinanleh Ezion Geber mun a tembawte asiet sieng tah ziehin akuon thei ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ahab tapa Ahaziah in Jehoshaphat kung ah, “Ka mite namite toh tembawte ah kuon khawm sah lei-la,” achia, hinanleh Jehoshaphat a ut sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jehoshaphat apu apate kungah a imuta a, tualeh David khopi ah apute kungah avuita uhi, tualeh atapa Jehoram ama thahengin leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tualeh Juda leengpa Jehoshaphat leenga apan kum sawm leh sagi kum in, Ahab tapa Ahaziah Samaria khopi ah Israelte tungah kum ni leeng in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa mitmu in silgilou abawla apa lampi leh anu lampi azui a, Israelte khelna bawlsah, Nebat tapa Jeroboam lampi azui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Aziehpen Baal a zui a, abie a, apan ana bawl zousie mabangin, Israelte Mangpa Pasian ana sulungthah hi.
  </para>
</usx>
